5.0,"When will Scorcese get his Oscar? If he does not get it for this film then I can conclude one of two things: The Academy is corrupt, or there is no G-d.  If you see only one film this year then ""The Departed"" is it.  An amazing film with stellar performances from its' all-star cast. There is nothing wrong with this film.  If there is one premise of this film it's who's the rat?  One works for the cops one works for the mobs and they have each infiltrated the others organization.  They know the other exsist and they must discover the identity of the competition before the other.  Trust me this film is a must see and if you don't see it or hate it you obviously suck.","",False,True,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-01","","RT","172846726"
