4.0,"Well, it was Scorsese so I had to see it, too bad it wasn't good enough to win Best Director...wait what?.......IT DID WIN BEST DIRECTOR?! HOLY CRAP! Seriously, the only reason why Scorsese won best director for this was because he has been robbed blind by the academy so many times before and they wanted to apologize. I'm not saying that the film was crap, it's just there have been so many other films he's done that should have won before this that it almost takes away from it.  But really it was a good plot and the acting was excellent for the most part, it just didn't have that same Scorsese flair that I've seen in so many of his other films. It definitely lacked something but even more so it throws something else in your face! To most accurately illustrate it would be to say that it's like someone gold in your face and going ""HERE YA GO- CATCH IT- CATCH IT NOW!!"" Without letting you adequately take it in and admire it. Overall, it was a good crime film and Scorsese did pull it through well enough to win the award, I just wish this didn't have to be the one to do it.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2006-10-03","","RT","271461323"
