5.0,"Amazing. Now, I'm really more of a drama or a fantasy/sci-fi or comedy type gal, but this film blew me away because it has the action and dry humor that makes adult psychological cop films truly a genre of their own. A genre that moves me and stays with me for a long time, but a genre that frightens me and one I can't experience that often. It's depressing--I mean, can there be so many cold people in this world? Ice cold killers, liars, and assholes? I loved the plot twists and...Mark. You blew me away, man. The human traits each character has to deal with, whether it be deceit, anger, terror...I loved it all. God this is the best cast ever in one of the best films ever. If Leo doesn't get his Oscar for this one, the Academy shall be disowned. Act accordingly.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-06","","RT","122132456"
