5.0,"Being a huge fan of ""Infernal Affairs"" I went into this film not expecting much at all esp with some of the crap Scorsese has made over the past few years.  Thank God i was wrong.  Alot of the film in its typical Hollywood way just reused the same ideas and scenes from its Hong Kong master copy.  The acting is another story altogether.  Every character was a stand out esp Wahlberg and DiCaprio.  I thought the final scene was a little cheesy but still it was fun.  A shit load of violence onbly helped this film become so good in my opinion.  Call me a bogan if u wish but I totally loved this film and would reccomend it to anyone and everyone.  Must see film of 2006.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-06","","RT","351290072"
