4.0,"In a post-summer season of films what more could we ask for. we get children of men then world trade center could there be another hit in the same month? well finally Martin Scorsese has gone back to making modern gangster films and gives us the departed and after 10 years was it worth the wait?

This film is by far the best Scorsese has done since goodfellas and i would say it even stands shoulder to shoulder with the best work of his carreer.

At a running time of 2 and a half hours this alone is enough to put most off watching this for fear of the film loosing interest etc but not here not a chance. it gripped me from the first minute and didnt let me loose interest once. 

As for the performances? not only the main cast but even the supporting cast are outstanding here. As for the oscar hype talk? i'd probably say nicholson has a good shot at being put up for best actor easily, his perfomace here is his best in a long time. But the big question? will this be the film that FINALLY gets Scorsese
that best director oscar hes been after for more than 30 years? in short no. This was a spectacular film in most aspects however i do think people will have a problem with the ending.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2006-10-06","","RT","311809093"
