4.5,"[i]The Departed[/i] is the ugliest film you'll love.  Not for the faint of heart, the film does dispense gallons of blood -- but the violence was not delivered with glorification or embellishment.  It's a beautifully crafted film about the ugliness of the underworld.

I cannot remember the last time there were this many strong performances in one film.  The story was engrossing and complex, but not too complex to confuse, frustrate or bore.  The tension descends almost from the first minute and doesn't let up until credits roll.  

This is truly a film to celebrate even if you must frequently avert your eyes from the screen.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2006-10-07","","RT","900784808"
