4.5,"According to this site, ""The Departed"", directed by Martin Scorsese, is the best reviewed wide release movie of the year. There's a reason for that. It is the best movie of the year. Featuring an all-star cast (Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, among others), this movie is yet another gangster crime offering from Scorsese that deals with an undercover cop infiltrating boss Frank Costello's (Nicholson) crew. While at the same time, Costello has sent one of his boys to infiltrate the police. Eventually, they each become aware of the other's existence and try to eliminate eachother. The usual Scorsese brilliance ensues.
 
""The Departed"" does not dissappoint one bit. Martin Scorsese continues to crank out gold. Let's hope he lives forever.
 
 
