    For anyone who doesn't know this movie it's about two cops who do not know one another. One is working for a major crime boss played by Nicholson. He tips him off and helps him with other things as well. The other is also working for Nicholson but he is the one trying to build up a case against him so he can be arrested. The movie is a remake of Infernal Affairs so I was kind of leary going into this. Since, I really liked Infernal Affairs and I'm not a fan of remakes. 
    However, this one worked for me because of the great performances. Everyone in this does a wonderful job especially Nicholson who seems to be having the time of his life in this. I also thought the music Scorsese chose worked well in every scene. To me the biggest downfall was the love story which I felt took up to much time. Otherwise, I liked everything about this. If you are a fan of Scorsese I predict you will definitely like this.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2006-10-11","","RT","900625067"
