What a genuinely riveting movie experience! An unrelenting thriller, particularly towards the final 2/3s of the film. It keeps you guessing until the very last second, an ending that many might consider a lame cop-out but is literally perfect considering the film's religious and political undertones.

Amazing performances from all; particularly DiCaprio who never dissapoints, an insane Nicholson (literally and figuratively), and a halarious turn at a smart-mouthed cop from Wahlberg.

