Jack Nicholson just seems to get beter with age, and every scene with him is rivoting and enjoyable. Leonardo DiCaprio is also at one of his best and Matt Damon was consistent but the thing about the two of them was that the two of them were lacking in connection. The rest of the cast all peformed pretty well.

