Battle Royale was a lot of fun. It's like Lord of the Flies... Japanese Shock Cinema style.  Seriously, it deserves all of the hype that surrounds it. It's an incredibly intelligent, creative, and well-made film. Sadly, it loses a bit of steam around its rather confusing ending.

