5.0,"[img]http://images.rottentomatoes.com/images/movie/gallery/1159016/photo_07_hires.jpg[/img]
  Ever imagined what it would be like to have Leonardo DiCaprio, Jack Nicholson, Matt Damon, Alec Baldwin, Mark Wahlberg & Martin Sheen all in the same movie. Well, Martin Scorsese was able to pull off this cast with his own American version of the Hong Kong thriller [i]Internal Affairs[/i] called [i]The Departed. [/i]Definately one of the best casts ever put together on-screen. The acting here is excellent & mostly all of the main roles here are Oscar[i]®[/i] worthy. The lead characters here are played by DiCaprio, Damon & Nicholson. The rest of the supporting cast including Baldwin, Wahlberg, Sheen & Vera Farmiga (from [i]Running Scared[/i]) is nearly perfect. This is definately one of the best movies to come out before all the Oscar[i]®[/i] buzz hits. I totally recommend this one, even if you are not a big fan of Scorsese, DiCaprio or any of the actors mentioned earlier. Check this one out now, because you won't be disappointed at all. It is easily one of the best movies of 2006. PEACE OUT!!!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-15","","RT","900676609"
