[left][size=3]The Departed is set in Boston, Mass. where the police in the city are having to go against high-risk and very much organized crime. It follows a mixed and crazy world of 2 enemies who are linked by 2 men just trying to keep their job and in overall perspective: their lives.[/size][/left]
[left][size=3][/size] [/left]

