[left][size=3]So I went into this movie with probably the highest expectations I have had for any movie this year considering most everyone had given it a 9 or 10 rating. What normally happens with high expectations in a movie are disappointment for me. This one I wouldn't say I was disappointed but I expected it to be slightly better. Dont get me wrong it was an excellent movie and I can see why its getting sooo much praise: But I thought the plot lagged too often and didn't necessarily always keep you wondering what was to come next. Now as you can see I gave it an 8 rating which is still VERRY GOOD and the acting is the main reason for that. There is no doubt in my mind that this was the best acted movie of the year and perhaps the best I have EVER seen and it easily got a 10/10 for that. But again the story was a little slow AT TIMES and just got about a 6 or 7 for me. Nonetheless a great a movie and definitely one of the more oscar-worthy movies of the year: BUT not my favorite...both United 93 and Inside Man were better (to me). [b]8/10[/b][/size][/left]","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2006-10-17","","RT","900800073"
