5.0,"While I feel this is probably the best movie of the year, I also have to note that in my opinion it still wasn't as good as some of the best films of recent years. Not to take anything away from the movie, because it was outstanding, but it could be a combination of the length and overly complex story that at times seems to stretch a bit. Besides that the viewer is given one of the most stellar casts in recent memory with DiCaprio, Damon, Nicholson, Sheen, Wahlberg and Baldwin. All of these men are exceptional and when filmed together really make you realize the huge gap between the A list actors and ""the rest"". The film itself takes a look at two opposite sides of the law, both with an extremely intelligent and motivated ""rat"" infiltrating the other. Each man works as well as they can against their own group without going too far as to be caught. As seen from the movie that line becomes extremely thin and dangerous at times. Certainly a soon to be classic, The Departed delievers a story and an ending that will certainly stay on the viewers mind for an extended amount of time even after the credits role.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-18","","RT","900744517"
