5.0,"All i have to say is 'wow!' I never expected a remake of a Hongkey movie to be this good. I was a bit sceptical of The Departed at first but the show just blew me away.

An already great story that's met with success in Hong Kong, Martin Scrosese revamps it for Hollywood.Throw in some great actors, add a few lines, and presto...an instant blockbuster!

The performance from all the actors were superb, especially Leonardo DiCaprio and Jack Nicholson.Mark Wahlber and Alec Baldwin just had some of the best punch lines.

Plot wise, its great. Its like Spy vs Spy. 2 moles trying to catch each other using ingenious plans.

The basic plot is about 2 moles infiltrating each other's organisation. Billy Costigan is a fresh graduate cop who's sent in on undercover to spy on Frank Costello, the boss of an Irish criminal organisation. Frank Costello on the other hand has been pruning Colin Sullivan since he was young to be a mole within the Massachusetts Plice Department. When both moles discover that their own organisations have been infiltrated (though they do not know each other's identities), they soon work to flush each other out into the open in this cat and mouse game.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-24","","RT","324239489"
