3.5,"Alright well, it has been a very very very long time since i have posted an entry here in my journal.  So please enjoy.
 
[color=red][u]The Departed - 7[/u][/color]
[u][color=#ff0000][/color][/u] 
[color=#ff0000][i]The Departed gets a 7 from me.  I really did enjoy it.  It has a wonderful cast of actors and a very intense story line.  I must admit that it was somewhat confusing at times, and still leaves you thinking at the end (which is not necesarily a bad thing).  It does leave room for a sequal.  You know, if they ever wanted to do one.  Still, all in all i really enjoyed it and it was fun and interesting to watch.[/i][/color]
[i][color=#ff0000][/color][/i] 
[u][color=blue]The Prestige - 8[/color][/u]
[i][u][color=#0000ff][/color][/u][/i] 
[i][color=#0000ff]Alright, I went to see The Prestige with a bunch of friends from church.  I think that is probably what made the movie more enjoyable for me is because we were all getting into it and asking questions to each other and stuff.  You know what I mean.  There were a lot of secrets in this movie.  Of course its about magic so there needed to be.  Just when you thought you had things figured out, you figure out you didnt have things figured out at all.  Wonderful performances by everyone and I think it is one of the more interesting films of the year.  A great plot and story line as well as great actors.  [/color][/i]
[i][color=#0000ff][/color][/i] 
[color=magenta]Thanx and have a nice day,[/color]
[color=#ff00ff]Dacaso[/color]
