5.0,"The Departed is best to be defined as a guy movie. In more words its an action/crime drama/ thriller/ romance. Lots of stuff goin on here if you get my rift. My favorite movie this year so far but I don't see it being beaten any time before the last weekend in december. It's very very entertaining and suspensful and is extremely well written. Probably one of the more violent movies in recent memory it involves dirty cops, undercover cops, and underground street crime in Boston. Remake of a hong kong movie called Infernal Affairs which I've heard is good but that the departed is clearly better. This is my favorite Martin Scorsese flick of all time as welll. I know people will disagree with me there but I didn't like goodfellas all that much. I liked this film a lot more, much more entertaining, many more plot lines as well. Leo Dicaprio, Mark Wahlberg, and Jack Nicholson all deserve nominations for this film. Dicaprio for best actor, Wahlberg and Nicholson for supporting. Best movie of the year for sure, if you havent seen it, go see it as soon as you can.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-10-28","","RT","900915501"
