2.0,"99% of this movie was great!  However, thanks to the 1% (last scene), it was totally spoilt for me.  This is a remake of the film Infernal Affairs and by and large is equal to it if not better.  But, thanks to the last scene (yes I am going to labour the point!) is ruined.  Its like the perfect car you have just bought, kicking alloy wheels, pumping sound system, tooled up with lots of toys, drives like sh*t of a shovel and all the ladies love you in it, you walk round it only to notice that some bast*rd has keyed it!  Its like someone serving you your favourite all time food and then taking a dump on it!  Cut the last scene from the film and you have a 4.5 star movie.  Oh and by the way just for those who watched it and didn't get the point, having a man walk onto the screen with a big bloody club, tw*tting the hell out of a baby seal is patronising to say the least!","",False,False,False,False,2.0,"2006-10-31","","RT","180612576"
