5.0,"This is the 2nd best movie of 2006. It's brilliant. If this isn't nominated for Best Picture, then something's wrong. I think this is the year for Martin Scorsese. He's been nominated so many times for Best Director and he's had no luck. But I think he'll get Oscar gold this year. 
 
Leonardo DiCaprio and Matt Damon were incredible. Jack Nicholson was amazing. He never gives a bad peformance and this is one of his best... he'll get a Supporting Actor nod (I hope). Wahlberg and Sheen were great, too. An all-around superb cast made this movie. 
 
The screenplay by William Monahan is awesome, too. I got lost halfway through the movie, but I recovered near the end. When this movie gets going you don't want it to end... at least I didn't. Most complain it's too long of a film, but I could have watched a whole additional three hours of this movie that's how amazing it was. It's a terrific film and I recommend this to everybody. 
 
[IMG]http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a107/jjdt25/departed.jpg[/IMG]
 
It's definitely one of the most talked about movies of the year and has tonnes of Oscar Buzz. I can't wait to hear what this film will be nominated for. It had a great soundtrack, also. This is just a perfect movie. Nothing more to say except it's very violent. The head shots in this movie are so realistic it's crazy. 
 
A very entertaining and very well put together film. Good job, Mr. Scorsese, good job. 
 
Overall, 10/10 :fresh: :up: 
 
One of the best films made in the past 3 years.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-11-04","","RT","900700288"
