5.0,"My brother and I caught this recently after a recommendation or five - and each time I was told to see it I was dubious - but in this case I want to thank everyone who told me to catch it.
THIS FILM IS AWESOME.  And I'm not saying that because my brother has recently started using the word ""Awesome"" to describe everything and has put it in my head, I'm saying it because it evoked a great deal of awe.  A massive quantity of awe.  Any film which can have you almost leap out of your cinema seat at moments to stand and gesticulate wildly at the screen with your jaw hanging loose deserves praise these days.
Leo DiCaprio I have to say puts in an amazing performance and carried the films weight for me - he's outdone himself.  Jack is classic Jack - although with an accent that seems a little off. And Matt Damon proves that work like Good Will Hunting and the fantastic Bourne Identity aren't just due to luck but some true grit.
I can't recommend this movie enough.  All the 5 star reviews have it right on - GO SEE THIS FILM.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-11-04","","RT","191824350"
