4.0,"Scorsese did a great job adapting the Hong Kong police thriller ""Infernal Affairs"" although some scenes were nearly identical to the original.  This fact makes me question all the praise that Scorsese has been getting for the film as it is not like some of the other work he is famous for where it was solely his vision that made the movie unique.  While this is a return to form for him, I would hardly say that his depicition of the material is ""brilliant"".  The casting director of this one should be the real hero here as she has assembled one of the better ensemble casts in recent memory with DiCaprio and Wahlberg in particular standing out.  The minor differences between this and the original were interesting choices that did not detract from the movie but did manage to make an almost direct remake quite different in tone.  I think this movie will get better as time goes on.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2006-11-14","","RT","139554417"
