5.0,"The Departed.  I haven't seen a movie this good in a while.  I watched it three times and every time I noticed things that I hadn't before.  It was so good that I actually dragged my mother to see it.  Something that rarely happens anymore.  I was so impressed with this film that I would like to give it more than 10, but that can't happen.  Oh well.

Flushed Away.  I had not really been looking foward to this.  It just seemed ridiculous.  But is was great.  The slugs were the best part with their singing.

Open Season.  This was also very excellent.  Though I would have liked to have seen it in IMAX.  It would have been great with the animation.

The Prestige.  This was a movie that I was expecting to be great.  It kept me on the edge of my seat.  But the end just didn't work for me.  It left me disappointed.  And that just ruins an excellent movie.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2006-12-07","","RT","900778719"
