4.0,"EXCELLENT!
This film is packed with so may A-list actors who each prove their worth. At first I was skeptical to see such an ""all star,"" cast but this film is not the case of too many cooks spoiling the broth. There are great and very convincing perfomances all round. It's clever, violent bloody, tense and very emotionally charged. I would have given it five stars except for one major flaw...it's a remake. Remakes aren't wrong, I just dont like it when the original is not fully acknowledged.., to me it's like plagairism! The original film(s) I'm referreing to are Infernal Affairs 1-3.  The departed is more or less a condensed version of the three with a few ""ad libs"" of its own. BUT, this is a VERY good copy/remake unlike others that have tried and failed e.g taxi, the ring, the grudge.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2006-12-26","","RT","451230924"
