3.5,"[size=4]The Departed (2006) ***[/size]
 
[center][img]http://img292.imageshack.us/img292/4667/thedeparteddn3.jpg[/img][/center]
 
I liked this movie. But i don't think it's anything out of the ordinary. It's a gangster movie, with a great story and great directing, but i felt there was something missing. Maybe it's because i don't really like action films. I do have to say that the actors were great, I loved Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, and Mark Whalberg. They made the movie more interesting and gave it more life.
 
I liked the plot twists, i didn't expect to see most of the cast die at the end. I hated that Billy was killed, but I was glad to see that Colin was killed too. I do think there were some plot holes, but it was a good movie despite that.
 
[center][img]http://img320.imageshack.us/img320/5274/thedeparted2jk0.jpg[/img][/center]
 
I haven't watched many mobster movies, but this one doesn't seem very original comparing it to other classics. In my opinion, this movie doesn't deserve to win the Academy Award for best movie like some people say, but maybe it does deserve the nomination.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2006-12-30","","RT","900928394"
