Great dialogue, other than how they said 'fucking' inbetween every other word. A million references to blow jobs and sex, it was crude and these where the basis of half the jokes, which where obviously lost on me. Hmm.

I loved the finish, great twist, un-conventional, shocking. Awesome. 

