5.0,"And Mark Whalberg gets the final word.
Fuckin rights.
Anyway, so so so so so so good.
Very very well done, Scorcese. Awesome cast, flawless performances, great soundtrack. I mean, Pink Floyd, Rolling Stones, Dropkick Murphys??? What more can you ask for.
So many parts of this film made me mad. 
Like when they threw Martin Sheen off the roof. I was so pissed.
And then at the end when everyone gets shot... I said ""fuck"" so much in those two or three minutes.
Also, not many films get twenty minutes into it before they even show you the title of the film.
