4.0,"This was a good movie...they key word here is 'good.' Not excellent, not extraordinary, but good. I'm not sure where all the over-the-top enthusiasm for this movie comes from. While I enjoyed the story and stayed intrigued throughout, the plot was convoluted at times. It expected the viewer to infer more than they really should have been expected to.
 
Of course, DiCaprio delivers another tremendous performance. Put him on the list with Depp, Hanks, Giamatti and a few others that do not deliver bad, or even questionable, performances. I think even Matt Damon was playing up to his competition as he pulled off his role very well.
 
Even though he probably doesn't deserve it for this particular film, I do hope Martin Scorsese wins the Best Director Oscar. He's been ripped off enough, especially by Eastwood...let the man have his statue!","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-02-01","","RT","900803488"
