[/color]          [size=3][color=Black][font=Arial Narrow]billy costigan (dicaprio) goes undercover to spy on a mob headed by frank costello (nicholson). colin sullivan (damon), the police detective in charge of the investigation, is a spy who tips off costello. let the police mind games begin![/font][/color][/size][color=Black]
