[/color]             [font=Arial Narrow][color=Black][size=3]""departed"" was definitely [/size][/color][/font][font=Arial Narrow][color=Black][size=3]an on the edge of your seat thriller. it had twists and near conlusion scenes. the movie was awesomely directed like always by scorsese. he always knows how to get the audience frustrated with camera angles and quick movement. the acting by dicaprio was great, damon could have been better. and then there was wahlberg, who did an awesome job as a foul mouth tough police chief, that hardly got enough screen time. the story kept me interested and the movie flowed. great for a friday night thriller.[/size][/color][/font][color=Black]
[/color]             [font=Arial Black][color=Black][size=4][size=3][font=Arial Narrow][font=Arial Black][size=4][size=3][font=Arial Narrow]  [/font][/size][/size][/font][/font][/size][/size][/color][/font][color=Black]
