4.5,"[size=3][color=yellow][color=yellow][font=Tahoma]Martin Scorsese has missed out on that elusive Oscar all his career but surely this time around he can only win. Of his six previous nominated films, I personally feel that this is not[/font][/color][color=yellow][font=Tahoma] necessarily[/font][/color][color=yellow][font=Tahoma] his best movie but then again Goodfellas and Raging Bull are landmark films. The Departed, featuring an all-star cast, is a remarkable film, keeping the viewer glued to the screen from start to finish. For me, the surprise of the film is Mark Wahlberg who has rightly earned an Oscar nominee. His screen time may be slightly limited but he steals each scene that he appears in. Of the leading actors, Leonardo DiCaprio provides a powerhouse performance that has consolidated his stance as one of Hollywood's leading actors. The Departed is an epic movie with a stellar cast that is more than worthy of the many accolades it has gathered!!![/font][/color][color=#ff9900][/color]
 
