3.5,"I really don't know what to say about this one..  The story was interesting.. not so much a ""who's who"".. more like a ""who is going to make it through alive"" scenario..   my biggest issue is that it felt like it took an eternity to end.. and most of the stuff in the middle just annoyed me..  They could have cut half of the material and it would have made just as much sense..  and the relationship with the girl.. not interesting at all..  she could have been taken out completely.   The good parts of the movie made it worth watching.. and the soundtrack is awesome.. 

