5.0,"Wow this movie has alot of everything that makes a great plot in a great movie. <br/><br/><br/>Why cant I be a mobster and get the same  damn respect and thought of pressure to imitate others of being the big cheese.<br/>It gets to be a who you want to win and who you want to die type of ploy. jack Nicholson is so tactful and interesting in this movie. it shows alot of great depth in his character which makes him amazing.<br/><br/> I think that Leo was brought out  to be more of a victim but he didnt really stand up to his character as he usaully is in other movies. I cant see him play a tough mobster for the most part but he didnt disappoint me. I think that matt was really superb in this movie also. I saw alot of great acting and he played his strengths well. I love how it make you wonder till the end.<br/><br/> I didnt think that it was predictable at all, I had no idea what was going on.  Which made the movie more meaningful I felt that also that this movie had alot of qualities makes this one of my favorites .<br/><br/>I really did think this was the best movie I watched all year.","",False,True,False,False,5.0,"2007-02-15","","RT","392935911"
