4.0,"Good film. The cast was awesome, everyone fit their characters beautifully, Mark was brilliantly over the top, Matt was cocky and scheming to perfection, and Jack was just fantastic - he plays the bad guy well... In particular I think Leo did a great job, and that means something because I don't always enjoy his performances.
The story was great, it took me a little while to get into it but I was reasonably immersed when the real stuff started to happen.
I have to admit for some people it could have been confusing if they're not used to this genre and Scorsese's style - he often doesn't give reasons for his added extras until the end when it all ties up and I've seen people get frustrated by the bits they think don't matter....
Doesn't get full marks because I'm horribly aware that I found it funny when I really wasn't supposed to (I'm obviously very inappropriate) but may be thats just me! I fear I have become most de-sensitised...
Overall I enjoyed the movie, but I felt I needed to be made to invest in it more then I did, perhaps then I wouldn't have laughed at things I shouldn't be laughing at.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-02-15","","RT","560378726"
