5.0,"When i first saw this film I wasn't too impressed but I think it was mainly because Scorsese deserved an Oscar long before this film. I managed to catch it on TV last night and I must say I was glued to the tv like no other film in a very long time. This is a magnificent come back for the king of Gangster film making and a brilliant remake, with it's own zing.

Leonardo Di Caprio was brilliant, though it pains me to see the way it ends. It leaves you shocked but so brilliantly done. To be fair though all the cast done magnificently. Matt Damon was great, Mark Wahlberg did a pretty damn good job too. I am not the biggest fan of Jack Nicholson but he can play an asshole pretty damn good and we all know it.

