3.0,"So this movie was...eh, what I expected, and not what I expected. I expected it to be violent and gritty, because it focused in Boston, and the Boston underworld is full of crime and drugs and sex and all that...and it did have a lot of those things in it. I did not expect for it to be so...random. I mean, yeah, there was a storyline to it, a very in-depth one, and the acting was absolutely superb from everyone involved. It just seemed like there was something holding this movie back. It just seemed like anytime the writers were stuck, they'd just have the actors say ""fuck,"" or ""fucking,"" or ""motherfucker."" And if they didn't know what to do otherwise, they'd have someone shoot someone. It just didn't seem like there was much of a point to the movie overall. And I don't mean to sound like someone with a stick up my ass. I don't mind violence or cursing at all in movies, it just seemed like the sole purpose of this movie was to be over-the-top in every way. I never really got a lot of things about it. But then again, I live in a very rural area, maybe I'd understand it more if I lived in a big city, I dunno. This movie was still average at best, to me. Three stars.","",False,False,False,False,3.0,"2007-02-22","","RT","80874265"
