4.5,"I was not sure what to think of this film going into it.  I am usually not that excited about undercover cop / mob stories.  This film was amazing though and totally surprised me.  I thought that the acting was some of the best ever done by all of the cast involved (not just the onces that have gotten award nominations).  Jack Nicholson is my favorite in The Departed though.  His character is rude, foul-mouth, paranoid, violent, and racist, but Jack Nicholson totally pulls it off and makes the character seem real.  I kept finding myself laughing at the stuff that his character would say.  He is a real joy to watch in this film.
 
The only problem I had with the film was the ending.  I do think that it got a little too out there.  It made me give the film a 6 after the first viewing at the theater.  After having watched it again on dvd with a friend, I have changed my view on the ending.  I do think that it is still a little too far fetched, but I do think that the outcome is the only one that would work for this film.  I do wish that Scorsese had gotten to the same outcome in a different manner though.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-02-23","adam a","RT","339967dd-2822-499f-9948-cf4cab1d6568"
