5.0,"The Departed tells the story of a leader of the Irish Mob named Frank Costello(Jack Nicholson).  Costello has a mole in the Police and the Police have a mole in Costellos posse.  Billy(Leonardo Dicaprio) is the Polices mole and Colin(Matt Damon) is Costellos mole.  Both Billy and Colin are trying to find out who eachother are because they are both a huge threat to one another.  The Departed has an Amazing ending, Great storyline throughout the movie, amazing characters(the best is probably the witty asshole named Dignam played by Mark Wahlberg), superb character developement with most characters and amazing acting.  If you are a fan of mob movies or you like anyone in the cast, Buy this movie...dont bother renting it because i promise any dude will love this movie.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-02-24","","RT","900919782"
