5.0,"I wanted to see this movie while it was on the cinema, but unfortunatelly it ended up being an 18 in the UK which meant I couldn't watch it. However I bought it finally last night, and I can safelly say that this is one of Scorsese's best movie to date! The movie is just oozing with style, substance and great acting. In fact I'd go as far to say this is virtually perfect. Notice I said virtually as there is one fault with this movie and that unfortunatelly is it is a little bit too long. Don't get me wrong the movie never drags on, but I can see where editing could have been used more effectively. But for a movie with such quality I can't lower my rating for it at all. The performances are top notch. Dicaprio and Damon both deserving high praise as being the two moles on the opposite side of the court. Dicaprio especialyl is brilliant, I think he should have gotten the Oscar nomination here rather than for Blood Diamond. Nicholson is gloriously over the top as usual and Mark Wahlberg is now my favourite to win the Best Supporting Actor Oscar this year. The Deparrted is a great movie and will hopefully earn Scorsese his first Oscar for directing, it deserves the Oscar for Best Film as well, just a brilliant film.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-02-25","","RT","900899405"
