4.0,"Martin is back to the top of his game. After 2 movies that seemed to divide his audiences, Scorsese is back doing what he does best and he hasn't lost his touch. With an awesome cast and even better director, this movie can do no wrong. Leonardo DiCaprio is slowly building up a good resume and Matt Damon adds another good movie to his already impressive one. Jack Nicholson is awesome, as always, and the supporting cast is great. The movie starts a little slow but it compensates because it shows us the burdens of leading a double life. Both our protagonists struggle to keep their covers while simultaneously exposing the snitch. This is Scorsese's finest hour since ""Goodfellas"". Great story, tight drama, and of course, superb directing. Two thumbs up, highly recommended.

P.S. Don't forget to check out the original ""Infernal Affairs"".","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-02-25","","RT","15953469"
