5.0,"Can I get another GO-O-O SCORSESE! Oscar win! And it's about time. I literally flew to the theater to see this. I hadn't seen a good mob flick in a long time, and though this one is not about the Italian mob, it had Leonardo DiCaprio in it. So I figured, good enough.

This film had us guessing from beginning to end. All-star cast, and great acting, for the most part. Now, the jury is still out on Mark Walhberg. If he is really a nice guy, then he did some incredible acting here. But if he is a d*ck in real life, then he sucks. Because I really hated his character. DiCaprio brought his usually brooding James Dean-esque persona to the helm. He's really good, but he's gonna have to lose some of that baby fat before he wins an Academy Award. He's just too cute. Jack Nicholson, on the other hand, does not have that problem. Each time I see him, he looks more and more like a wizened old buzzard.

Excellent movie, and the ending is just grand.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-02-27","","RT","532268330"
