3.5,"DiCaprio is merely a box office draw and has been since his career started.  He is one of the most overrated actors in Hollywood.  Thus, when he delivers an average but respectable performance as he did in ""The Departed"", critics overreact by falling all over their own words to insist he is brilliant.  Many actors could have played his part in the film.  Some would have done a better job such as Johnny Depp.   Scorsese was given a gratuitous Oscar for not receiving one he should have been awarded for Raging Bull, Taxi Driver or Goodfellas.  As for the critics well, considering what they had to choose from in 2006 it is not surprising they would admire this film so highly.  In the cinematic world of the blind, the one eyed man is the critics crown jewel.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2007-03-04","","RT","900797383"
