4.5,"Absolutely amazing film.  Definitely one of the best movies of 2006 and deservedly so got the Oscar for best film.  Everything about this movie jumps out at you.  The acting, the writing, the directing, the editing.  Every actor more than held up his/her own, it's hard in a film like this with so many big stars to have everyone get their own screen time but this film managed it greatly with a few exceptions:  I really would have liked to have seen more of Mark Wahlberg's character but apparently if the sequel IS confirmed it will be about his character.  Other than that minor little complaint, I have nothing bad to say about this film.  Hiiiiiighly recommended.

