4.5,"[center][img]http://www.geocities.com/rmohan802/movies/the_departed/poster1.jpg[/img][/center]

[left][size=4][color=black][b][/b][/color][/size] [/left]
[left][size=4][color=black][b][u]MPAA Rating:[/u] [/b][font=Comic Sans MS][color=silver][b]R[/left]
 
[/b][font=Verdana][color=#000000][b][u]Runtime:[/u] [/b][font=Comic Sans MS][color=silver][b]151 minutes
 
[/b][font=Verdana][color=black][b][u]Tagline:[/u]
 
[/b][font=Comic Sans MS][color=silver]Cops or Criminals. When you're facing a loaded gun what's the difference?
 
[font=Verdana][color=black][b][u]Plot:[/u][/b]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS][color=silver]A remake of a Hong Kong thriller, the movie is about two undercover moles -- Billy Costigan ([i][color=lightblue]Leonardo DiCaprio[/color][/i]) is a cop posing as an irish gangster while Colin Sullivan ([i][color=lightblue]Matt Damon[/color][/i]) is a mole in the FBI feeding information to the mob leader Frank Costella ([i][color=lightblue]Jack Nicholson[/color][/i]). When the moles are sent to find each other, violence and bloodshed begins!
 
[font=Verdana][color=black][b][u]Plus:[/u][/b]
 
[font=Comic Sans MS][color=silver]Superb direction, great dialogues and fast paced action that will keep you on the edge of your seats. Solid acting by all the stars and [i][color=lightblue]Leonardo DiCaprio[/color][/i] stands out with his intense performance
 
[font=Verdana][color=#000000][b][u]Minus:[/u][/b]
[/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/font][/color][/size]
