4.5,"What a top movie!!!... firstly the editing was great, nice and brisk. The direction was awesome never knowing where the camera was going to be and the quick cuts of vertical shots displayed horizontally kept things jumpy and askew. This movie captures you from the get-go and doesn't let you go... stopping along the way for the idiosyncrasies of the major characters giving you a depth in such a short amount of time...its boggling. Martin Scorsese killed it... he is most definitely the man and completely deserves the oscar (should have gotten it ages ago). Such a complex script that doesn't lose you at all and keeps things current with the mobile phone use I thought was a nice touch. Top notch cast, with the notables of Jack Nicholson (who scorsese keeps on tight reigns) Matt Damon & Leo DiCaprio outdoing themselves, giving us a nicely balanced yin & yang. I really liked Dignam (Mark Wahlberg) very notable with the comedy relief and just crass dialogue kept me grinning. I really enjoyed this movie and wish that I could erase my memory (just a few hours) just so that I could watch this movie again for the first time.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-03-22","","RT","582186874"
