4.5,"It had been long enough since seeing Infernal Affairs that I had forgotten a lot of the plot details--and so The Departed seemed fresher than it might have. Jack Nicholson steals the movie, in the same way that Daniel Day Lewis stole Gangs of New York--an incredible villain with depth and a complex moral horizon. Alec Baldwin and Mark Wallberg also have great parts. DiCaprio and Damon were modest--not nearly engaging as their Asian counterparts. However this interpretation does make Infernal Affairs seem almost too slick.

