4.0,"Woah!  Man, it's been a while.  Well, I've basically had to get away from this place for a while, because it was getting to the point where I was on here so much I was starting to think like all of those super powerful critics.  Giving the bad films nothing but crap and the good ones even more of it.
 
 So, I am back, once again, with my crappy/un-professional crique of a few movies, some old and some new.
 
