5.0,"Wow, I don't feel well at all right now.  I feel like I am close to death from lack of proper sleep.  Oh well.  Just published a very in depth review on God of War 2.  You can find it [url=""http://www.protokulture.net/?p=46#more-46""]here[/url].  The game was extremely sexy.  I however, do not feel extremely sexy.

The dark portal cards were released and they sold out almost instantly.  I was lucky to get a starter deck and an extra pack.  Anyhow, what the fuck is up with my feeling like a zombie?

[b]The Pursuit of Happyness
[/b]This ""biopic"" is about a black guy who really exists who decided to actually sacrifice the good things in life to make it big.  He's broke and he is slowly falling into debt.  He has a wife who I could not stand and he has a kid who is very smart and supportive.  He lives with his dad after his parents split up and they both lose their home after his dad completely fails to make any money.  

They are homeless as Will Smith works his way through an internship for six months without any kind of pay.  It was a little bit scary to see how bad it can get, but both son and father held their heads up.  The movie ended on a good note and I suppose it was rather inspiring.  You simply gotta work to get what you want.

[b]Turistas
[/b]I really thought I was going to get a cheap version of [i]Hostel [/i]when we popped this in the DVD player.  Little did I know that I was about to travel into the world of vigilante horror films.  Yeah, the movie has some odd brand of vigilante justice in the sense that some Brazillians are kidnapping tourists and stealing their organs.  

The movie isn't a gorefest.  It has boobs and it has retarded people that can't make good decisions.  You know, people that you usually want to die?  Yeah, well.  There you have it.  I can't say much about this one except that it was an okay movie.

[b]The Departed
[/b][i]The Departed [/i]was something fresh to see.  Jack Nicholson plays a mobster, and of course he kills the role.  Leonardo Dicaprio really killed his role as well.  Matt Damon even did a pretty good job.  These three actors really destroyed all of my expectations of film with their awesomeness.  This movie was so fucking good.  I won't even go over the movie at all.  WATCH THIS FUCKING MOVIE!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-04-13","","RT","900720899"
