4.5,"[size=2]This movie is excellent one of the best of 2006. Martin Scorsese his back with one of the best films of his career. Once again Scorsese delivers a film that meets or exceeds the expectations of it's audience in nearly everyway. The story line of The Departed will keep you enthralled from the second you put it on to the very last minute. The acting is without a doubt superb. Matt Damon and Leonardo Di Caprio give the performances of their careers( making an exception for Good Will Hunting). The Departed and Scorsese deserved best picture and best director at the academy awards. The Departed is nothing shot of Spectacular. A real triumph for the director. The Departed has earned it's place along side such classics as Goodfellas, Raging Bull and Scarface. A Masterpiece.

