4.5,"How can you go wrong with such an all-star cast and top-notch directing?  Well...you can't really.  However, this movie is not perfect (minor plot inconsistencies and a bit too many simple twists and turns at the end), but very few movies really are. Nonetheless I really did enjoy this movie, like I said the casting was perfect and Scorsese directed with his usual skill.  And don't get me wrong, even though in the end the twists go back and forth a bit too quickly, it was still a very entertaining flick which was definitely worth seeing.  Lived up to all the hype...maybe, maybe not.  Good movie with great actors...definitely!","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-05-01","","RT","186191785"
