5.0,"This is as perfect a film as Scorsese has ever made, and he made Taxi Driver, Goodfellas, and one of my favourite films: Raging Bull.  I've seen the original Infernal Affairs and as good as that film is, The Departed uses exactly what's great about that film and makes it better.  DiCaprio, Damon, Nicholson, Wahlberg, Sheen, and Vera Farmiga.  Stellar cast, solid action, tension, and suspense.  This is a film about men living double lives and being lost in their lies and who they really are.  That is a recurring theme in all of Scorsese's movies.  Another example why Scorsese is the best filmmaker alive.","22edf868-4d54-4a3e-8a30-b955b03c0e46",False,True,False,False,5.0,"2007-05-17","","RT","368056766"
