4.0,"The only real problem I had with this film was more of a personal nature.  For some strange reason I have often had problems keeping Leonardo DiCaprio and Matt Damon apart and the fact they were both in the same film but working on opposite sides confused me right from the beginning.  So much so that after about 20 mins I stopped the film and started again.
I shouldn't really count this as negative for the film though seeing as I am probably the only person in the world who confuses these two actors.
I'm told it's a remake... that will worry me only very little seeing as my dislike of Asian films is already known here on flixster.  Hard to follow in places (unless of course you have a real criminal mind) but otherwise quite an exciting film.

Does Leonardo DiCaprio always have to die in his roles??","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-05-26","","RT","166084421"
