4.5,"I watched this movie in theatres and had trouble reconciling this movie with the original, Infernal Affair, so I thought it was a bad translation. But after watching this movie again, I realize that this movie is supposed to stand on its own and it has quickly become one of my top 5 movies of all time. Not comparing this movie to the original, has given me a greater appreciation. Although the movie is characterized by the violence and crude humor, there are some really great acting moments. Plus, I'm biased towards the movie's immersion in the Boston culture. i'd have to say that this is one of Leo's best acting jobs, considering that he is limited to playing a cop but definitely does a good job in conveying the self hating prophecy of being a rat.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-05-26","","RT","781710287"
