5.0,"This movie is lots of fun. Fun in how the plot unfolds, how the characters eat at the gritty dialogue, and how Scorsese just seems to be enjoying himself. One of the best ensemble films in a long time, I just can't express the joy I had in watching what Scorsese does best: entertain. He brings such a jolt of energy and style to the complex story that it never runs out of steam. Even though it's long, the pacing is superb, constantly raising the tension and danger all the way to the breathless conclusion (which was shocking and a wee-bit of a cop-out). Nonetheless, despite the vicious ending, the story is thilling and the unmistakable style of Scorsese make this one of the best films in a very long time.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-05-27","","RT","672086591"
