5.0,"Martin Scorsese has a great movie every decade.  The 70s had ""Taxi Driver"", the 80s had ""Raging Bull"", the 90s had ""Goodfellas"", and now this one for the 2000s.  Leonardo DiCaprio is finally doing some good work, as well as Mark Wahlberg.  The action's good, the deaths are gruesome, there are plenty of twists and Jack Nicholson is creepy as Costello--he ad-libs a few times.  Watch for the scene where he creeps up behind Leonardo DiCaprio in the bar.  Favorite line: ""Maybe yes, maybe no, maybe fuck yourself.""","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-05-28","","RT","781837841"
