4.5,"It is surprising that this film would win an Oscar for best picture, considering its content, but perhaps it is poetic, for this is Scorsese returning to the kind of edgy, violent, realistic gangster film that made him a legend in the first place, and it was those very films that were so criminally neglected by the Academy. The plot sounds like it is going to made your brain bleed, but by focusing very heavily on his characters, Scorsese makes following the story easy, and all that's left to do is enjoy every twist and turn of the plot, and the brilliant performances from Nicholson, Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, Matt Damon and especially Leonardo DiCaprio.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-05-29","","RT","256975111"
