4.5,"In yet another example, I avoided this movie for quite some time thinking I would hate it...As it turns out, it was actually an engrossing and entertaining film.

I'm pretty sure this is a very rare instance of me actually enjoying a recent ""Best Picture"" winner.  The ensemble cast was awesome....Even though I had heard about how the majority of the plot (having known pretty much all the major spoilers), I was still able to enjoy it.

