5.0,"Fast, dense, crackling dialogue, funny and gut wrenching. Can't wait to see it again. What a joy to see Jack really kickin' it again. Everyone's at the top of their game and they're all brilliant.
Third viewing now and it just gets better. Some moments obviously benefit from the surprise element that comes with being seen for the first time but there's so much to savour (so much that I missed the first couple of times) that the lost shocks are more than made up for.
Leo, Matt and Mark are all dripping testosterone, Alec Baldwin is hilarious and Jack is truly repellent. He's brilliant and at 70 years old a bloody inspiration.
I'll watch it again sometime and in the meantime I'll wish that Vera Farmiga would turn up to sort out my emotional problems.
Hail Marty! What's next?","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-05-29","","RT","781808669"
