3.5,"I don't see what makes it movie of the year. I personally liked the ending (though some people thought it ruined the film) but there's nothing here we haven't seen before, whether you've seen Infernal Affairs or not. A little double-crossing, a boatload of cursing, and some snappy violence are all this really amounts to. There isn't a sympathetic character or an accessible life study in the whole bunch. It's cold and calculated and stunningly made, but it's missing the humanity.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2007-05-29","","RT","781834932"
