4.5,"How long has it been since a good movie didn't need over the top action sequences and wild special effects to be cool? Well Martin Scorsese proves that a movie can be smart and still be awesome. There is very little action in this movie, and its all dialogue. Yet, ITS STILL INTENSE. Rather than get worried about some doode hanging off a cliff, you are on the edge of your seat wondering how Matt Damon is going to talk himself out of the mess he's in. In a way your rooting for all the characters, but rooting against them as well. This is filmmaking at its finest, at least compared to most of the lame stuff we have been going through recently. (cough pirates sequels cough spiderman 3 cough)","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-05-29","","RT","160588122"
