5.0,"I have found a new respect for Leonardo DiCaprio as an actor since watching Blood Diamond and now seeing The Departed. The intensity in this film is created equally by the actors, as well as the actual story and screen play. Mark Wahlberg played the unlikely hero and was a hilarious ass-whole of a character as well as a well intentioned guy. Jack Nicholson was twisted and demented and played his role very cool. Matt Damon played the type of guy who you just want to punch in the face but probably wouldn't. Recently, Matt Damon has scored roles in many great action flicks such as the Ocean movies, and the Bourne trilogy, and now The Departed. The twists and turns this movie takes are exciting and all around awesome. I had to really follow this movie to make sure I knew exactly what was going on, and even then, I still wasn't expecting every twist they threw at the audience. The Departed has great direction and was produced beautifully and is now one of my all-time favorites.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-01","","RT","782113797"
