4.5,"Scorcese did it again. This time he got his due and it was completely justified. Between the incedible script, the fantastic acting and the fluid editing, it just made me want to see more of this world. This negates the argument that there shouldnt be any remakes, because as much as I love Infernal Affairs, this film blew it away by miles. Im sick of hearing people bitch about-""Oh if I had 5 A list actors Id have a great film too."" No you wouldnt. Shut up. It takes a great director to weave huge stars into an ensemble cast without egos taking over and ruining production. Put this with Taxi Driver, Raging Bull, and Goodfellas, with his classics.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-01","","RT","782006763"
