4.5,"I cannot believe the kinds of praise that this movie is getting across the board. It seems that every critic, including the awesome Roger Ebert, is following this strange trend. This is not a bad movie by any stretch. It is a good movie; it is a very good movie. Is it one of, if not, the best movies of the year? No, it is not. It is nothing more than a masterfully executed cop thriller with little weight to it and little substance as well. If you want to see some great cop thrillers, watch the Dragon Dynasty DVD of ""The Infernal Affairs Trilogy"". These are the movies upon which ""The Departed"" is based. They are also vastly superior in every way. The one good thing that has come from this movie is that Martin Scorsese has finally received an Oscar for Direction. Albeit, for the wrong movie (try ""Raging Bull"" or ""Taxi Driver""). This movie is good; it really is. It's just not that good.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-02","","RT","649553694"
