5.0,"One of my all-time favorite movies, and definitely the best movie I've seen in the 2000s decade. Everything is top-notch, from Martin Scorsese's directing, from all the actors performances, including Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, Ray Winstone, and Martin Sheen. Even Mark Wahlberg was great, I didn't think he would fare well in this movie, but he turned out to be a scene-stealer and ended up being my favorite character. For those of you who like action/crime/thriller movies, this has all the good stuff. A great storyline with twists and turns, bloody violence, an awesome soundtrack with songs from the Rolling Stones and Dropkick Murphys, a heaping load of profanity, and even more bloody violence. I've seen this film over 10 times now, and I'm comfortable with saying it's one of my all-time favorite movies. Highly recommended.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-02","","RT","782245924"
