4.0,"not as good as i expected it to be, but alot better than what my friends said it would be.

the movie felt like celebrity mole. an all-star cast, and just about every important character was a famous/memorable actor, which was kind of distracting. great performances nonetheless.

felt dicaprio and matt damon gave excellent performances, but i'm not a huge fan of jack nicholson. i find him kind of annoying in the ""look at me! i'm jack nicholson! i sit courtside at every lakers game"" kind of way. i wish he had taken the role more seriously. i think overall, the movie would've been better as a more serious movie. mark wahlberg was a beast. marky mark was prob the best character in the movie. and who can forget AWEC BALDWIN, best actor EVAR. (ignore my stupid team america allusion, lol)

the lead girl was kinda hot. if psychiatrists look like that, i'm about to get me one. haha.

ummm, i forgot what i wanted to say, i shoulda reviewed it immediately after watching it last night.

overall, TEH DEPAHHTED is a suspenseful, well acted movie, with memorable quotes, that keeps you on your toes until the end. won't be one of the best or most significant movies you see, but it's good enough to recommend. 4 stars

