5.0,"To start, this is one of the only movies I can remember that took my breath away the first time I saw it.  Leo DiCaprio, Matt Damon and Jack Nicholson all give Oscar worthy performances.  Martin Scorsese rightly one an Oscar for his direction in this movie.  The script is air-tight.  Great dialouge, great acting, and great plot twists.  Its an edge of your seat thriller until the very last scene.  The viewer can really connect to and feel for each of the two main characters (DiCaprio and Damon).  Great supporting acting by Wahlberg, Sheen and Vera Farminga as the love interest.  Based off the Hong Kong classic Infernal Affairs which to my knowledge is supposedly a very fine movie as well.  Everything about The Departed supports the Academy's decision to name it the picture of the year.  RECOMMENDED.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-03","","RT","782344073"
