2.0,"""Hi, Hong Kong. We're Hollywood. How are you?""

""Just fine thanks.""

""Oh we'll see about that.""

""How so?""

""Well we like your tiny little Infernal Affairs movie.""

""Errr it's the best selling Hong Kong movie of all time.""

""Right. Anyway we'd like to take your movie, piss all over it and give it a few oscars and take ALL the credit whilst then claiming it's actually a Japanese film.""

""Hey you can't...""

""SHOOT THEM ALL. DOWN WITH JAPAN.""

There's my review. Thanks Hollywood for yet another pointless ""remake"" because you can't come up with something original anymore.","",False,False,False,False,2.0,"2007-06-04","","RT","782588517"
