5.0,"The Departed is a Martin Scorsese-helmed remake of Infernal Affairs that changes the setting from the Triads in Hong Kong to the Irish Mob in Boston.  Scorsese does the improbably and actually surpasses the original by adding his usual gritty touch, the Rolling Stones, and Jack Nicholson.  The film is also not burdened by much inferior sequels like the Chinese original.  I highly recommend both The Departed and Infernal Affairs but advise people to watch its sequels with caution.  At least they are not Godfather III or Star Wars prequel bad.  I hope the studio does not make The Departed.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-05","","RT","783150451"
