4.0,"As a big fan of mafia movies, my mentality going in to this movie was really set on decrypting the plot. I was able to somewhat and my girlfriend was able to as well...Now when I say predictable it's because I immerse myself in mafia culture when I watch a movie so it's easy to tell the direction in which the movie is headed. Although I personally do not like DiCaprio, I idolize the duality of Nicolson and his amazing ability to turn other actors into great ones on screen. They played off of eachother really well and I think I am starting to warm up to DiCaprio style of acting. A great film that incorporated a lot of great actors as well as a good screenplay, based on a true story really makes you wonder how much was artistic and how much was reality.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-05","","RT","782990016"
