4.5,"There are a few things I'd like to say about this film.  In terms of an overall undertone and the style that is attributed by the way it is shot, cut, etc.,  I don't think it really works for this film.  It lacks alot the dark, grittiness and harshness of reality that it could have achieved.  It's a bit light-hearted, even compared to Internal Affairs.  But, the true strength of this film is the screenplay.  The more I watch it, the more I realize how well written it is.  With all the deception, betrayal and different relationships between the characters, the screenplay holds it all together and doesn't let the film fall apart, which it EASILY could have done.  This movie could have been exceptional with a different undertone.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-05","","RT","782267048"
