0.5,"Ridiculous. Probably if I was never exposed to foreign movies I would want to see this movie. Simply because all of it is an Americanized version of another movie, this movie being the Hong Kong blockbuster hit Infernal Affairs. To actually give the director of this movie an award was preposterous to me because almost none of it was his own idea and work. Lets make a simple analogy: I am sure if you're a movie critic you've seen the Ring and you know about its original Japanese version, Ringu. Even though that movie was not as much of a success whether in Japan or here, thats like giving an award to the Ring but not it's original, Ringu. I suggest if any of you really are film critics you should see Infernal Affairs first which was made 2002, four years before Departed was made and its two sequels in 2003 before even considering to see the Departed.","",False,False,False,False,0.5,"2007-06-07","","RT","783599527"
