5.0,"Hands down this movie blew all the other movies in 2006 out of the water! Martin Scorsese has deserved an Oscar for years upon years and the year of this movie was no exception. I was so glad he got it for this film though. Every character I was intrigued with... People died who I didn't think would die... Actors characters were funny and sad where I didn't believe they could be... From the beginning of this movie till the end I couldn't look away... there was no macho hero in this film... no complete scary monster for a bad guy... not that Nicholson's or Damon's character's weren't complete pricks... it wasn't so much in your face as other gangster movies... Nor was it a movie where the lines of right and wrong are blurred... it was diffidently clear... it just seemed like a more well rounded movie... you weren't sure which chacacter was shaded in grey... you weren't sure who was good or bad... And hands down the biggest twist to an ending I have ever witnessed. I wish I could give this movie a review it deserves... but the best thing I can think of to say is... This movie belongs on everyones movie collection shelf!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-07","","RT","783635646"
