4.5,"The Departed is an incredibly entertaining film. It's a gangster film, but it's different from most gangster films in that it has brains. Sure, there's plenty of senseless violence, but the movie really makes you think. Nicholson's performance is hilarious, quite the character. DiCaprio, however, shines the brightest of all the big name talent in this film. If you can handle the violence and the profanity and you want to see a smart movie- I highly recommend it. Hell of an ending too.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-08","","RT","784061363"
5.0,"This movie keeps you going, around twists and turns you couldn't possibly predict. Amazing acting (especially by Leonardo DeCaprio and Mark Wahlberg), a fun soundtrack and a realistic setting capture the intense dynamic between cops and underground gangs. I haven't seen the original Japanese version yet, but I've heard it's not to be missed. Props to Scorsese for pulling off an American remake- this movie had me floored every time I watched it.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-08","","RT","782152101"
