4.5,"First, let me assure you that this IS a five-star movie.  It's got an all-star cast, with a world-class script and really well-directed screenplay.  It keeps you on the edge of your seat the whole time, and the plot twisted so much that I'm not sure I know anybody that could actually predict the ending.  Nicholson does absolutely amazing, as expected of him.  DiCaprio, however, showed that he can truly be a dramatic actor, and not just some ""Titanic"" pretty-boy, and I really enjoyed his performance. It gets 4.5 stars, though, because of the length of the movie.  I felt it was JUST a hair too long for my taste.  Yes, I agree, if it was any shorter, it would have been incomplete and therefore not a good movie at all.  But, given that, it's still long as hell.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-08","","RT","784070968"
