3.5,"This gets a bit crazy at the end with the ridiculous number of twists, but it's still a really intense crime drama. Everyone played their part really well, but the minor police characters really stood out as particularly well done: Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, and Alec Baldwin were excellent in their roles. The violent twists at the end of the movie were shocking, and so, in that sense, well done, but they were also just too much. It became a bit muddled and you'd have to write up a diagram of who was working for who and who betrayed who, and I believe that subtracts from the film. Still, well done. I only wish they'd have waited to give the Oscar to Scorsese for ""Shutter Island"" this year. (Granted, I have no idea who I'd give Best Picture to in 2006. And, I still haven't seen ""Inception"" from this year.)","fb89e559-3e47-46f5-8ea9-f4a20cc0c638",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2007-06-09","","RT","783857262"
