5.0,"Hey who doesn't like Jack Nicholson?  He's the man, and I think he's shown that to us again in The Departed.  But hey I can't forget about the others, Leonardo DiCaprio, Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, and Matt Damon who all offered explosive performances.  This film shows us that Scorsese is a true master in film making, and with out a doubt one of the best in the industry.  This film will not only make you laugh, it will grip you tight and it won't let go until the very end.  Look out for plot twists, surprise endings, and a lot of great action Scorsese style.  This is a smart and deceptively entertaining film that makes me want to watch it over and over again.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-10","","RT","782851645"
