4.5,"In my opinion this film was 2006's best.  Heck, this was one of the best films I've ever seen.  Now Scorsese is a great director, but he has a knack for gangster films.  Having taken a periodical break, Scorsese makes one heck of a return to the genre.   This film is such an enjoyment to watch.  It's intelligent, witty, and down right captivating from when it starts until the credits roll.  Nicholson makes an incredible villain while DiCaprio (who I couldn't stand previous to watching this film) makes a great 'hero'.  Seriously one of the best films to come out in years, The Departed is an awesome gangster movie and an great film in general.  The language is harsh and the violence is rough and gritty, so it isn't for the squeemish.  But for those who love these kind of movies, watch it.  It's incredible.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-06-11","","RT","782202721"
