5.0,"""The Departed"" is Martin Scorsese's best film since ""Goodfellas,"" which isn't a surprise given the similarity between the two films.  Watch the beginning of ""Goodfellas,"" then watch the beginning of ""The Departed.""  One can almost imagine Ray Liotta's voice-over and Jack Nicholson's voice-over engaging in dialogue with one another.  Leonardo DiCaprio proves he is one of the best actors of his generation.  Matt Damon gives maybe the best performance of his career.  Jack Nicholson shows that he can still carry a film for extended periods of time.  Nicholson completely sets the tone at the beginning of the film.  Without him, ""The Departed"" is dramatically different.  Mark Wahlberg is simply brilliant.  ""The Departed"" is the best film of 2006.  Period.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-13","","RT","784518587"
