4.0,"'Cops or criminals - when you're facing a loaded gun, what's the difference?' - This powerful story of cops and criminals is full of dramatic irony and high tension. The whole cast perform excellently. Jack Nicholson is superb as the mob boss and Leonardo DiCaprio and Matt Damon are perfect oppositions. Mark Wahlberg also shines in an angry and violent role, which is different from any of the other character's he's played. The film is tense, well-paced and full of twists. My only negative is that there are a few to many casual expletives, but despite this minute flaw, This is everything you could ask for in a crime thriller. Superb.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-13","","RT","398655712"
