3.0,"Nasty thrilling little gem from the great Scorsese. With movies like this I'd rather have a cast of mostly unknowns, but hey, then we wouldn't have the pleasure of Jack's psychotic performance. Corruption breeds amoung the most righteous of us, yet I would have preferrred a little more backstory and subtlety to the characters to show how that corruption actually gets seeded and develops over time. The director seems to take delight in setting up a bunch of guys to kill each other via complicated, manipulative, and coercive ways. Yet Scorcese has trodden down this bloody path many times before. Let's add a little more dimension and depth to these people for the next flick, eh? I found myself not caring about any of them and wanting them all dead by the end. Predictable to some degree, and that's not a good sign from a master filmmaker.","",False,False,False,False,3.0,"2007-06-15","","RT","782883656"
