4.0,"Finally watched this film and it was very good. The intricate story following two men who are double crossing there employers, while at the same time are trying to catch each other out, very captivating with a fair few heart stopping moments of pure anxiety. The plot development is very well shown thoughout in the two complex stories interlinking in many ways. The character development of both Damon and DiCaprio is very intersting, portaying two very gripping characters who are cracking under the stress of there double lives! Nicholson plays the Crime lord and he does a great job of it! The ending is rather unexpected which makes the whole film from start to finish a must see","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-16","","RT","783623033"
