4.0,"I'm kind of sad that I didn't see the original before I saw this.  I was initially ambivalent about this.  How could a movie with so many ""good"" actors chewing up the scenery be as great as everyone says? I finally sat down to watch it and was quite impressed.  I have a few minor complaints.  For how gritty everything was supposed to be I was kind of disappointed that the lighting, colors, and so forth were clean as a whistle along with all of those digital bullet hits.  Also, HALO THAR Bladerunner pursuit sequence.  I initially felt like the ending was a little bit of a cop out, but the more I let it sink in, the more I enjoyed it.  I'm definitely going to check out Internal Affairs.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-20","","RT","783816232"
