5.0,"I can't say how great this emerald really is.  The cast: fit for a King.  The music: perfect.  The screenplay and acting:  one of a kind.  The careers of Leo DiCaprio, Matt Damon and Mark Wahlberg could've been made with this film alone whereas veterans like Jack Nicholson, Martin Sheen and Alec Baldwin make the film almost insanely good!  It's really rough, but it suits the characters, no doubt.  I've often been asked who did the best job, and that's pretty damn hard to answer!!!!!  But after lots of thinking, I decided Mark did the best acting job, Jack was by far the best badass, and finally Leo was by far the coolest character.  I jus dunno why he didn't go for Best Actor from this movie instead of Blood Diamond (not that Blood Diamond was bad, but he was jus better in this!)  Matt Damon also did a great job.  I even liked Anthony Anderson in this!  One of the best movies of all-time, especially for guys like me who seem to be doomed to become crime lords, ha.  Bravo Mr. Scorsese!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-22","","RT","786124819"
