4.0,"i have not seen internal affairs, on which this is based, but on its own merit i would recommend this film for gritty realism, style, snappy dialogue, good scene choice and story-telling and gripping drama. scorsese is a genius of directing and it is clear to see how talented he is at weaving a story using talented actors to drive it in the directions and styles he wants it to go.

leonardo dicaprio plays an undercover cop infiltrating nicholson's irish mafia, while matt damon plays a bent cop who becomes a mole in leo's special forces department for the same criminal group. what follows is a tense battle between the cops and the robbers as each mole struggles to stay hidden, simultaneously using whatever they can to unearth the other and save themselves. the cast does the story justice, a film well worth seeing.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-25","","RT","785225563"
