5.0,"An amazingly deserving Best Picture winner for a change, The Departed is a film that is almost one of a kind. Being a remake of the Hong Kong thrillfest ""Infernal Affairs"" with some of America's best up-and coming and established film talents, a legendary director Martin Scorsese, this film had ""Blockbuster"" written all over it from the get-go.

This is truly a rollercoaster of emotion that constantly has the viewer rooting for a different character in each scene. Jack Nicholson turns in his most memorable performance in quite a long , while Mark Wahlberg and Matt Damon surprise audiences with stunning performances that show naysayers that these young actors can be taken seriously as genuine talent.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-25","","RT","786330480"
