3.5,"A movie which was expected to win awards and did. Here we have a solid cast including Nicholson, DiCaprio, Wahlberg, and Damon. All of these seasoned actors gave us another Hollywood look at the organized crime scene. In being a good movie it was at times but particularly hard to follow and you really have to keep yourself peeled to the movie from the first few minutes or else you will be completely lost. The plot twists were the movies trump card. Putting differant scenarios into perspective you wern't sure exactly what would follow in the progressing scenes. As many others feel the ending was rather agressive and I was left bewildered. If you have not seen it yet I will let you make your own opinion on the ending but I personally thought it had background reasons for ending the way it did end and not just over-simplifying the ending and making it predictable and the usual boring 1 sided deal. Sort of like how ""Sopranos"" on HBO ended - - that really pissed people off. One of the better movies in 2006. Stars: 3.5","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2007-06-26","","RT","786404413"
