4.0,"The more I think about it, the more I liked this movie.  It was crude, graphic, and sometimes just ridiculous *cough* Jack Nicholson *cough*, but so is life.  That being said, the plot was simple but interesting at its roots.  The problem was that some of the events which embellished it were confusing.  The acting was top notch from a top notch cast and the little bits of humor were well delivered (Alec Baldwin talking about marriage).  Sometimes the cast walked the overacting line but it seemed stragely natural.  I have mixed feelings about the ending.  What bothers me isnt how ugly it is, but more how abrupt it is.  I guess it may have been the only way to end something so twisted and complicated.  Finally, the soundtrack was awesome.  Definitely worth seeing.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-27","","RT","786193019"
