5.0,"Scorsese scores big with his best gangster drama up to date. Brilliant performances, addicting storyline, and a pace that keeps you engrossed at all times. No doubter for the Best Picture award. Notice how there's always music in the background. Kept it flowing at an unbeatable pace. DiCaprio matures with every coming perfomance, Damon proves he's still one of today's greatest young actors, and Nicholson adds to the veteran, all-star studded cast; not to mention he's hilarious. Outshines Goodfellas on all cylinders. A movie worth seeing many times. To really get into it, don't take any breaks; just sit back, watch intently, and prepare to be awe struck. Mark Wahlberg had me cheering in the end; I was actually rooting for someone to get killed; imagine what effects this masterpiece has on its viewers. A movie to remember for years to come. Always remember: ""Some people say you can be a cop or a criminal, but I say when you're facing a loaded gun, what's the difference"".
""I want my environment to be a part of me""","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-06-28","","RT","785927944"
