4.0,"Here is my review! 
Something was missing from this film. I believe the problem lies with the fact that none of the characters are really anyone I'd gave a damn about(not a good thing in my book). I didn't ""feel"" for them or jump out of my seat(figuratively speaking)for any one performance. Its a film that almost takes itself too seriously. The Good- Excellent casting; Leo is a gem of an actor. Jack does what he's good at - being himself. Alec Baldwin is fun to watch and his chemistry with Wahlberg (should have won an Oscar)made the film ( The whole F- word exchange in the meeting room).Weak links - Matt Damon; felt like he wasn't really  trying. A good film but definitely a step down from Goodfellas. Scorcesse handles a new breed of actors very well. I would have given it an excellent 4.5 stars if it had a little more heart to it, but 4/5 for entertaining me none the less.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-06-30","","RT","782726512"
