5.0,"I've never seen Internal Affairs, the Hong Kong original of this film, nor do I care to... This film by Scorsese is a masterpiece of thriller suspense, brutal violence, and smart humor wrapped up with superb character development.   DiCaprio shows a talent I wasn't aware he possessed.  This may be his career performance to date.  For the first time ever, I count myself a fan of DiCaprio.   Wahlberg was stellar and my only complaint was he didn't receive enough screen time.   Damon and Sheen were well cast for their parts.  Nicholson was his usual mad self.  This is one I could watch more than once.  Very worthy of the 4 Oscars it received.  

