4.5,"This was a GREAT crime thriller about two undercover people - one working for the cops, spying on the mob guy, the other working for the mob guy and spying on the cops, and each is given the job of finding out who the other is. It could get confusing at times if you aren't paying attention, but the payoff in the end is well worth it and completely unpredictable, and the cast is all top marks across the board.

They probably could of lived without the love triangle though where both undercover people fall for the same girl and she falls for both of them. it seemed tacky and made an otherwise kick ass movie seem a tad bit less believable, and even though the movie is really damn long, if you're invested in it then that runtime just zooms by.","98e922f1-2d13-4a23-8668-767ae2efbd72",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-07-01","","RT","785044745"
