5.0,"SUPERB! Truly one of the greatest films ever made and, I have to say Scorsese's BEST WORK. Now don't get me wrong, Martin's amazing and he deserved the nod for best director numerous times before this picture, but this story culminated with THE BEST ensemble cast that I have EVER SEEN is truly impressive. The cast is superlative and the best culmiantion od acclaimed actors that I've ever seen, yet one actor's presence or performance does not overshadow or detract from any other actor. It is truly impossible for me to distinguish who, in my opinion, gave the best performance, and I cannot even say who my favorite actor was. It was simply remarkable to see this cast conveying this great story. And now the story: This plot, while having innumerable twists and turns, fueled by countless jolts of progression and near devastation, I've never been so enthralled for over two hours in watching a film in this capacity in all my life. And while there are hints of a modern integration of policing techniques and setting (hence Damon's text message within his pocket) there is a timeless quality to this that, I'm sure for generations, will be just as thrilling and awe-inspiring as it was for me. Extremely realistic and impressive attention to detail, from the dialogue, to the setting, to the dialects and presentation in every aspect of this picture. This is an exceptional film which truly shook the cinematic community in bringing a viable crime drama to the stage and putting significant effort in creating a classic. I truly feel that this experience is what a moviegoer should enjoy in every picture and this is what the medium is all about, the evoking of emotions coupled with cinematic intensity. This is truly a film that mus tbe seen by everyone.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-02","","RT","782631193"
5.0,"I loved it!  Hard to follow because there is so much switching back and forth ...but great actors breed great movies!  I could not believe how this ended ...saying anymore will give the ending away ...but be prepared to be blown away ...literally!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-02","","RT","786709927"
