4.5,"An excellent movie. A relentless, hard- boiled and engaging crime-thriller. A piercing bullet of excitement and head bashing fun. It's sizzling, crackling, intelligent, and breathtaking. It's tension-loaded and adrenaline-pumping from beginning to end. An instant classic. Director, Martian Scorsese's masterpiece. A powerful, riveting and explosive film. A total powerhouse. It's just simply awesome. It's remarkable, enjoyable and sensational. Stylish, slick, brutal, wickedly funny and magnificent. Plenty of twist and turns and relentlessly cool groove all on it's own. An incredible all-star cast that have awesome chemistry together. Every performance strikes powerhouse gold. Leonardo Dicaprio and Matt Damon are electrifying. Dicaprio has never acted with such fire or power as he does in this. Damon is charming, witty and sensational. Martin Sheen and Alec Baldwin are brilliant. Mark Wahlberg is terrific, he's sly, compelling and fantastic, giving a performance that stands out while being cool, confident and relaxed. Ray Winstone is marvelous. Jack Nicholson has never been better, his best performance in year's.","d3a0c5c5-dd11-4bf7-a54b-104786caf1f6",False,True,False,False,4.5,"2007-07-03","","RT","200490042"
