4.0,"okay so  i totally loved this film the first time i saw it, but i have to admit, it was a programming screening and because we were unlikely to play the picture, I got held up at the office and was late.  I missed exactly the jack nicholson intro bit (i found out later) - came in at the establishing of the present day situation.  and i totally loved the film.  i was so excited I took a cab back to the office and called everyone under the sun on the way telling them I had just seen film of the year and tipping Nicholson for the Oscar nod.  Imagine my horror when on my second viewing in its theatrical release, when I saw the entire movie with that WEIRD blacked out Nicholson's face intro, and the lurching from Gimmee Shelter into another song altogether, etcetra, in the diner scene.  WEIRDNESS!  Anyway, having just watched it for about the 6th time, I have got to say, although it is a dynamite performance by DiCaprio, (and great support from Wahlberg and Sheen), the film as a whole is not ageing as gracefully as the undoubtable genius of GOODFELLAS, CASINO or RAGING BULL.  But hey you really shouldn't be complaining when studios are making films that are this good.  Good actors turning in great performances and thoroughly credible entertainment.  Shame about that weird 10 minutes at the start tho.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-07-04","","RT","786867690"
