5.0,"Wow...wow. Everyting about this movie was great. The acting was amazing (just look at the cast!), the directing was brilliant, the music was perfect, even the lighting was great. This is what the modern blockbuster should look like: it's smart, gritty, and involving. Jack Nicholson runs a little wild in some parts, but do we expect anything more from him? And say what you will about Leonardo DiCaprio's past movies, but this one catapults him out of that ""pretty boy"" image that so many hold him to. Not since the Lord of the Rings trilogy have I been glued to the screen for two-and-a-half hours. Everything about it swelled with experience. Oh, and the ending was phenomenal.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-08","","RT","786869806"
