4.5,"I love Irish Mob stuff. Pretty interesting remake. I think it's a good remake, and I don't care that it's a remake. Remakes aren't in themselves bad.

Anyway, atmospheric, great acting, and cool plot twists. Not Scorsese's best, though. Glad he won the Oscar, though.

A rant: It's pathetic that the man lost at the Oscars so many times.

People still watch Taxi Driver, Raging Bull, and Goodfellas, and all lost to inferior movies. Who doesn't like Rocky? But it isn't better than Taxi Driver. Raging Bull blows Ordinary People out of the water, and Goodfellas will always be better than Dances with Wolves.

Gangs of New York, okay, it's mostly style, little substance. I get that. But the Aviator completely blows Ray and Million Dollar Baby out of the water.

So I'm glad Marty won, but he should have won sooner. 

Anyway, enough ranting. Awesome movie, go watch it.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-07-08","","RT","785251938"
