1.5,"I hated this film.  I was completely entertained by Nicholson & Winstone, so I didn't care about DiCaprio, or Damon.  DiCaprio was miscast, as in a fair amount of scenes (such as the scene in Queenan's office at the beginning of the film), his voice sounded as if it was going through puberty, & I didn't find him believable as a tough guy, & I didn't like his character at all.  Damon just didn't have the right ""look"" for his character in my opinion.  He came off a bit forced sometimes.  The film has pointless errors & twists that make more plot holes.  Too Hollywood, too conventional & the love triangle was very stupid in my opinion.  One of Scorsese's worst films.","",False,False,False,False,1.5,"2007-07-09","","RT","787447256"
