5.0,"I loved this movie!

The story of the mob having a mole in the police department and the police department having an informant in the mob at the same time is fairly intriguing in its own right, but the way Martin Scorsese handles it makes it absolutely engaging.

I'm glad to see that Mark Wahlberg got a Best Supporting Actor nomination as he played his police captain role to assholish perfection, and I think that Leonardo DiCaprio should've gotten a Best Actor nod for his role here as opposed to Blood Diamond, cause he was excellent in this movie. 

I'm glad people finally got over the Leo Titanic overhype of 10 years ago and recognized this guy for being the great actor that he is.

Anyways, I'm rambling now, I wanna talk about the movie more, but if I did, I'd probably end up spoiling the plot, so I'll just leave it at that.  

In short, The Departed's an awesome movie.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-10","","RT","782569464"
