2.0,"The Departed is one of those movies where everyone loves it....but a few don't....and I'm one of those few. Now...I'll talk about the positives first, there are plenty positives and those are the things that people love about the movie. 1)the cast/acting....all supurb and I don't need to even mention it....my only disapointment as far as it goes would be Mark Wahlbergs character...(however Wahlberg does it nicely...his character bothered me) what is his point in the movie? Every other scene he spends it cussing and acting like an angry dick...I have no problem with cussing, but to some extent....theres no point. 2) The plot, I love the idea of the movie....2 guys going undercover....one for the bad guys undercover cop.....one for the cops, undercover bad guy......however, the movies runtime is 2 and 1/2 hours and by the end....it feels forever...the movie has parts that drag...a lot....and other points where you have no idea whose the good guy and whose the bad and I know thats the point....but when it's just too confusing to enjoy.....and the main part I hate about the ending is....well...it's a ""cop out"" ending....a cop out ending is when the writer has run out of ideas so he kills off all the main characters...and thats exactly what happens....so if you think the payoff of a 2.5 hour movie with this much invested and this great plot will be awesome...think again..you get to see all the characters killed off...and nothing left...so instead of taking home satisfaction from a terrific movie...you're left empty inside....(that is if youre like me and enjoy a terrific story over anything).....the final point I want to talk about is the violence/killing....it is done greatly! It's not gratuitious, but it fits nicely!...Even if the ending sucked, this movie wasn't a total waste of money....The rest of the movie wasn't bad...just....it could have done so much more with the ending to make you feel like you got your moneys worth.....Conclusion : I dont say dont see this movie....but I dont recommend it....it's up to you, youre a fan of the genre....check it out if you wish...Overall : 2 stars.","",False,False,False,False,2.0,"2007-07-12","","RT","787750267"
