5.0,"The more times I see it, the more I love this movie. ""The Departed"" features four top-flight actors and performances backed by a complex and drawn out plotline that takes a few watches to come to grips with. There are tons of sets; it must have taken a long time to shoot and produce, but this is Scorsese's best film ever by a long shot. The violence isn't a dwelled-on concept in this film unlike Scorsese's other works, as he says ""it's the first film I've ever done that actually had a real plot."" Watching movies like ""Cape Fear"" and ""Goodfellas"" makes you realize just what an incredible movie this is in comparison. A must-see.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-14","","RT","781835829"
