4.0,"This movie was so close to greatness that the half-baked finale drives me even crazier than it would drive me on a lesser film. For two hours, 'The Departed' is a tightly paced, exciting thriller with brilliant acting and screenwriting that would have merited five stars. At the end, it totally collapses into a rushed, poorly-thought-out sequence of scenes that spoils the movie entirely. Had a little bit more time been taken in thinking of an appropriate ending for the story, this movie could have been one of history's great Mafia flicks - but ultimately, it turns into just another action movie...maybe a smart action movie, but nonetheless just an action movie.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-07-15","","RT","784276739"
