4.0,"Although not as Oscar-worthy as movies like Goodfellas or Raging Bull, this is still classic Scorsese. With great visuals, a compelling story and a fantastic cast (including Jack Nicholson, Alec Baldwin and Mark Wahlberg attempting to steal every scene they are in) the only downside to this movie is that at 2 1/4 hours it can drag in parts. Unlike the original, Infernal Affairs, The Departed attempts to cover the whole of the character's back story and as such loses some of the impact of the original. The love triangle is especially plodding, however there is enough swearing and bloodshed to help keep the interest when you get bored of Leo pining in the rain.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-07-17","","RT","785729318"
