4.5,"Sometimes, reviewers bust a collective nut over a movie for some  arbitrary reason. Like, it has Jack Nicholson in it and it's directed by Martin Scorcese. Actually, that's not true, a lot of reviewers have panned Marty's last few movies. Anyway, The Departed's really good. It presents a gritty underbelly in South Boston, Southie as they call it, with a full plate of great performances. Matt Damon is a prick, Leonardo DiCaprio is surprisingly extremely good, Mark Wahlberg, during the little time he's on screen, is a funny asshole, and Alec Baldwin's neurotic police captain steals scenes. And, of course, Jack Nicholson's well, Jack Nicholson. He might not affect the total over the topness of his Joker character, but it's still Jack Nicholson. And for that, we are happy.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-07-18","","RT","787697146"
