5.0,"Clever, in depth, long, star studded, violent, with lots of swearing.... These are the things we we have all grown to love in a Scorsese film and this was no different. As mentioned, the star studded cast include the likes of Jack Nicholson, Matt Damon, Leo DiCaprio, Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen and many more, but it has to be said that the acting here was the cherry on top of the cake. And the other ingredients to this movie make you want to lick your lips at the sight of it too, for example: Perfect direction, witty yet intense dialogue, chemistry between the cast, great action scenes. Admittedly i was apprehensive before watching this as i feared it would be overrated but boy am i glad i took the time (two & a half hours) to sit and watch this. no regrets, just five stars out of five.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-26","","RT","787644361"
