5.0,"Scorsese understands the language of film. The acting is almost perfect all around (Jack Nicholson still has ""it"") and the plot is near perfectly written. What more do you want in a movie? A+ acting, A+ plot, I get chills thinking about how brilliant this movie is. So much conflict within each character and situation that you don't know which way any of them might go. That's what does it for me. I could not predict where each character's choices would take him/her. Most movies are just cookie cutter nonsense where you see the same premise, same character types, same plot, etc. This film is almost textbook perfect. Brilliant! Freakin' brilliant.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-07-27","","RT","788884014"
