4.0,"This movie blew me away.  At first I didn't think it would be good at all but in fact it was one of the coolest mafia movies around.  It's all about the inside man...both of them, the mafia has someone in the police force and the police have someone in their mafia, the entire movie is spent with one trying to figure out who the other is, and the suspense of whether they'll find out about each other or not keeps you rivetted to your seat.  The movie also has an allstar cast with great acting.  I highly recommend this to everyone its a great movie.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-07-30","","RT","788743070"
