4.0,"I admit, I am not much of a Scorsese fan.  In fact, a couple of his are films I despise most (Casino, Aviator).  Still, every once in a while I find a gem and this is one of them.  The Departed is excellent in so many ways and definitely a top notch action film.  The plot is very creative and well written.  The leads all play their part perfectly, especially Jack Nicholson, who I always love, and Mark Wahlberg.  But with all this going for it, it loses half a star for excessive language, so be forewarned.  This is Scorsese after all.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-07-30","","RT","789054295"
