3.0,"""Well, that was messy.""  That was my comment as the credits began to roll.  My wife and son readily acknowledged the assessment.  In other words, The Departed is violent and nasty -- and there's really not a lot more to say about it.  Yes, Leo is becoming a really solid leading man, and it is always fun to watch Jack, and Scorsese's frenetic direction is superb.   It is worth watching if those things interest you.  But there are violent movies with insights at the core which justify the violence in the story, like the Godfather, and then there are violent movies with nothing at the core except more violence, like The Departed.","",False,False,False,False,3.0,"2007-07-31","","RT","787566017"
