4.0,"Scorsese's best film since Goodfellas, what we were all waiting for all this years! As usual, Scorsese does a perfect job in directing, even showing some of his own camera works, shots and editing effects. On the cast, just amazing! Everyone does an excellent job, and I'm not only refering to some of them, but every single actor/actress... But to me the ones that make an outstanding performance over the rest are Leonardo DiCaprio, who seems to get better and better each year; Jack Nicholson, bringing to life one of the best characters on 2006; Mark Whalberg, annoying and irritating; and Matt Damon, who didn't get so much credit but was incredible as the good/bad guy. <br/>Also, the music choices were great, very fit to the movie. The writing outstanding, the whole story and shocker were perfect, and of course the Scorsese signature facing the end of the movie.<br/>In conclusion, one of the best movies of 2006!<br/><br/>Directing: 5<br/>Acting: 5<br/>Story: 5<br/>Originality: 4.5<br/>Visual elements : 4.5<br/>Impact: 4<br/>Enjoyment: 5<br/>Music: 4.5","2810e5de-4e84-42b5-b956-d7092bfa3d2a",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-08-05","","RT","293083274"
