5.0,"Another Scorsese flick in which he uses alot of big name Actors. For some reason many movies cannot get by when they employ too many big name actors because it seems to draw away from the movie itself. But of the movies I have rated, both Scorsese flicks are packed with A-List actors, but it does nothing to detract from the great movie. This is a great crime movie and in my opinion, it is better then most of the typical Italian mob movies of the 80's or 90's. Although many of them are very good, it seems that the movie scene had become over crowded with movie after movie after movie, made about the Italian Mob, and how they were gonna ""whack someone"" and this movie comes alont and is based in South Boston which is a predominantly Irish city. A great movie either way ending in typical scorsese style","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-08-12","","RT","790026222"
