5.0,"I haven't seen a movie that is just all around good like this in a long time. It's a shame that more movies aren't made like this. It had a solid cast, good acting, good lines, good plot.

Okay, there were some messed up parts of the movie mainly due to Jack Nickleson (who is one f'd up guy). I wasn't expecting the kind of movie that it was, I was expecting more of a mob type Godfather thing, but it was more of a cop movie. Not that that's bad, just not what I was expecting.

Now if someone tells you there's a twist ending, kick them. Because they don't know the definition of it. Someone told that to me and pissed me off when it wasn't delivered. The ending is really good, but in no way was it a twist. They don't blow your mind away like in Fight Club or some weird supernatural crap, that's a twist ending. You just don't see it coming.

Other people said it was confusing trying to keep up with who's playing who and all that, but I felt it was handled just well enough so you thought you know, but you're just not that sure.

This movie deserved the Academy Awards it got, it's the best of the year.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-08-13","","RT","786315248"
