4.5,"This is probably one of the better movies I've seen to date. Not only does it have a mix of action, comedy and drama, but the acting, cinematography and script combined with an all-star cast make this film that much more enjoyable.

While it's true that I haven't seen a whole lot of other movies that drop ""f-bombs"" every few seconds, I actually found the cursing here to be....at least a little tasteful. I can easily see how others can think it's over-done, but it really didn't bother me. Plus, pretty much every line that comes out of Mark Wahlberg's mouth is pure gold!

I've also never been much of a fan of Leo DeCaprio, but I really honestly enjoyed him very much in this movie. His ability to basically play two roles combined into one character is commendable.

Of course Martin Sheen, Jack Nicholson and Alec Baldwin are all complete winners as well.

Overall, I loved this film! Martin Scorsese outdid himself on this one. 4.5/5 stars!","a1ae2964-d490-4c33-87bb-b6870ac3dae9",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-08-16","","RT","785193226"
