5.0,"With one of the most all star casts in history of movies, you have extremely high expectations, and fail does it not to surpass even the highest.  Every characters performance is genuine and real.  The storyline and plot is twisted and deep to the point where it will have you guessing until the very end.  Creates suspense when it needs to, sharpens itself if ever becoming dull with unorthodox and perfectly directed brutality.  This movie is a truely a masterful web of plot brought swiftly together to bring the viewers one of the best dramas ever produced.  Near perfect in every area, with unbelievable performances from every cast member, this is a must see for everyone.  All the hype and all the awards are well deserved!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-08-17","","RT","780519280"
