5.0,"This is probably going to be known as one of Scorsese's best along with Taxi Driver, Raging Bull, and Goodfellas. He takes a different approach than just normal gangland activities that he explored in Mean Streets, Goodfellas, and Casino. He borrows the plot from  the Hong Kong crime film ""Infernal Affairs"" and puts his own spin on it. Involving the Irish mob in Boston's southside and the Mass. State Police. Having an all star ensemble cast of DiCaprio, Damon, Nicholson, Martin Sheen, Alec Baldwin, among others, this is truly a modern classic.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-08-21","","RT","785897011"
