5.0,"An absolutely fantastic film!  I love it!  A great director, a great cast, a great script; there's not a single negative thing I can say about this movie.  Leonardo DiCaprio was fantastic, Jack was great as always, and I have to say this is without a doubt one of Matt Damon's best performances!  I felt he was much more deserving of an Oscar nomination rather than Mark Wahlberg, even though he was good, Matt Damon was better.

I still maintain that Scorsese should have two other Oscars (for ""Raging Bull"" and ""Goodfellas"") but better late then never, right?  This was an absolute deserving Oscar for him.  Definitely one of his best films.

Every Oscar this film earned was well deserved, although I have to admit that I was a bit surprised when it won Best Picture.  Still, I'm not complaining.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-08-25","","RT","784494039"
