WELL.... let's start with the incredible cast... and when I say incredible I mean that they were one annoying actor away from blowing the whole movie... Seriously!  Matt Damon, Alec Baldwin, and Leo Dicaprio in the same damn movie! Although I suppose Leo has proven he's not a complete woman in the last few ""films"" that I've seen him in... 

Anyways I'd say the ending mostly lived up to the hype... Thank God they added that last little part... I hate it when dumb actors get roles that require them to be alive at the end

Jack Nicholson and Mark Wahlberg were good as usual... the whole thing made me chew my nails in anticipation for the 15 seconds of climax... I guess even smart people aren't immune to bullets

Most of the movie hides behind a good cast and plot... the action is mostly non-existant... the characters are smarter than the Gilmore Girls on speed so the confrontations are quick and dramatic

