5.0,"Roger Ebert just wrote a review for this on his website (rogerebert.com) that sums it up better than I could. But 5 stars anyway.  Other things I like: Alec Baldwin saying ""Micro-praw-sess-ahs.""  And also Alec Baldwin's line ""You wanna go get a smoke? I'm gonna go have a smoke.  I bet you don't smoke do ya?  You're one of those health nuts, aren't ya? Go fuck yourself!""  Why focus on Alec Baldwin?  Because he's billed like 6th in this movie and his character is still awesome.  The top dozen characters in this movie get their due and they all deliver their lines like they're cracked-out on speed.  Alec says this line so fast it hardly has time to register in your brain what he just said. You want to laugh but you can't, 'cause you might miss the next line of dialogue and you'll be forever lost 'cause you gotta listen to every fuckin' thing in this movie and watch every fuckin' one second edit or you'll miss somthing in this movie and the convoluted fucking plot will be lost to your brain.  And writing a review for this movie makes you want to talk and type in the style of all the characters in this movie.  Wonderfully exasperating is how I'd describe this movie and it demands to be seen three times.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-09-01","","RT","784828679"
