5.0,"I saw 'The Departed' a few weeks before it came out at an advance screening. The trailers for it looked cool and it had a very promising cast. I sat in the theater, enveloped in the darkness, not really knowing what to expect since I hadn't read any reviews for the movie. And then the film started. I can't really describe the pure ecstasy I felt watching ""The Departed"". The film starts and doesn't stop until the credits roll. I've never been wrapped up in a movie the way I was wrapped up in this masterpiece from Martin Scorsese. ""The Departed"" was not only my favorite movie from 2006, it is my favorite movie of all time.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-09-03","","RT","785439112"
