4.0,"Martin Scorsese does it again, this time with a twist on the Whitey Bulger / Irish Mob in Boston story. His crackling sub-plots and amazing performances in ""Departed"" create yet another classic with a criminal backdrop to go along with ""Mean Streets,"" ""Goodfellas"" and ""Casino."" Jack Nicholson is absolutely mesmerizing as the underworld boss who keeps the cops at bay, along with his ace-in-the-hole snitch in the works played by Matt Damon. DiCaprio shines as the bad kid trying to do good with a little help from a tempermental Mark Wahlberg and a kindly father-figure in Martin Sheen. Alec Baldwin turns in a great supporting performance as the head of the State Trooper Task Force trying to capture Nicholson's Costello. With trademark musical intrludes highlighting the on-screen action and Scorsese's brilliant use of the camera, ""The Departed"" falls right in line with it's classic predecessors and will soon be one itself.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-09-06","","RT","784732183"
