4.5,"This movie was superb.  Perfectly acted, amazing intricate story, and an ass-load of awesome lines.  The story was my favorite part of the movie.  It was an amazing roller-coaster of a story with twists and turns and perfection.  Unfortunately that rollercoaster runs dead into a brick wall.  The ending to this movie made me want to punch babies.  It was as if Martin Scorsese had realised the movie would be too long if he wrapped it up sensibly,so he just stopped it.  (SPOILER) He couldn't come up with anything quick enough, so he just kills off everyone.  Nutsack.  Two characters that weren't barely even part of the movie emerged in the end to off main characters so the story could end.  It's as if some characters were created for the sole purpose of killing off the main characters.  This pissed me off.  Other than this fact, this movie was awe-inspiring. But the ending subtracts a half-star.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-09-08","","RT","789790838"
