4.5,"While being a great film in its own right, this film in my opinion was inferior to the original film that it was based off on. While this movie did have more violence and the hilarious character of Dingham, this version made a huge mistake in trying to combine the two female characters from the original into one. What added into the drama for the original were the two female characters who added more depth to the original two main characters. The only other problem was that the relationship between Costigan and Queenan was relatively weak compared to their counterparts in the original. In the infamous death scene where Queenan's character gets thrown off the building, the reaction from Costigan gave off very little emotion to me to the point where Queenan's death almost meant nothing. While in the original, Yan's reaction paired up with the dramatic music made it so that you clearly felt all that shock and pain.

Well enough of that. All in all though, this movie was definitely a great movie and definitely one of the top films of 2006. It definitely deserved the best picture oscar.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-09-09","","RT","792773933"
