4.5,"The Departed is a stroke of entertainment genius. While far from Scorsese's best film (it has to take a backseat to Casino and Taxi Driver at the very least), and absorbed in a horrendously pulpy plot which dissolves the moment one starts thinking about it, the movie is nonetheless extraordinarily entertaining from start-to-finish. More violence and action than most Scorsese films, but still faithful to his style. Jack Nicholson is a bit much, chewing scenery as the leering crime boss, but Leonardo DiCaprio proves his Titanic days are far behind him, with Matt Damon and Mark Wahlberg also contributing fine turns. Alec Baldwin, Ray Winstone and Martin Sheen are also effective.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-09-30","","RT","789018698"
