2.5,"I don't know who is in that bloody Academy Award jury. According to me this movie is totally NOT worth ANY Oscar! Dammit.
What is so special about this movie? What is so special about the direction? This is just a normal maffia thriller.
The cast consists of many famous faces but none of them is really giving his or her life performance. I like <i>Jack Nicholson</i>, always liked him. He got a role that fits him very well. The others are barely visible in this very messy, jumpy and chaotic movie.
In fact the movie is so chaotic it starts to become boring very soon. Scenes are mixed up and the viewer is not allowed to even cough or the plot is gone.
The few jokes in this movie were very bad and there is way too much swearing. Of course it's about the maffia, they are no angels I know. But still. Too many fucks and very irritating language.
If only <i>Tarantino</i> directed this movie and chose the actors, it may have been worth an award...
Ok, something positive to end with: the movie keeps the viewer guessing until the very end. It's a real good whodunnit.
<BR>Of course I would not recommend this movie to anyone.","",False,False,False,False,2.5,"2007-10-02","","RT","375338028"
