4.5,"A great film with a climax that reminds us that happy endings aren't guaranteed in real life, particularly in the gritty underbelly of the crime world. I recommend "" The Departed"" as a must-see if you're a fan of the crime drama genre - it's right up there with the best. While it's certainly not the greatest film in the Scorsese canon (it doesn't have the depth of, say, ""Taxi Driver"" or even ""Goodfellas"") and the Nicholson performance was a bit over-the-top, I feel ""The Departed"" was as good as advertised, with the added bonus of powerhouse performances by Damon and DiCaprio.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-10-03","","RT","796228401"
