4.0,"Martin Scorsese places his favorite theme in the contemporary age, and delivers well. A story about the hide and seek game between the gangs of Chicago and the cops, and the moles that they let into the other's turf. Leonardo Dicaprio and Matt Damon give their roles some punch; one as an angel pretending to be a devil, holding his own as he watches the innocent die quietly. And the other as the devil pretending to be an angel, spewing vileness in the most silent ways. Leo is at his dramatic best, but Matt Damon is excellent and sometimes even makes you hate his character. Mark Wahlberg is not to be ignored, with his cameo that even got him an Oscar nomination. Smoothly violent, but highly engrossing.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-10-04","","RT","789582779"
