5.0,"By far and away the Best Picture of 2006. Master storyteller Martin Scorsese and screenwriter William Monaghan have crafted the best crime classic since 'Goodfellas'. The funny thing about this movie is it's the only movie from 2006 that I actually saw three times in the theater. Actors Wahlberg, DiCaprio, Sheen, Baldwin, Damon, Nicholsen and Vera Farmiga are as good as they've ever been in a motion picture. This film truly deserved the best director and best picture oscar, which is why I'm ecstatic it won. Scorsese has been reinventing the crime genre for decades and finally got recognized. If you see one movie from 2006, make it 'The Departed'. Ranks as the best picture of the year (2006) on my top ten.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-10-08","lesco b","RT","8a043958-bd59-4a34-8b31-bd35ae90ea74"
