4.5,"Great fucking movie, good acting from Jack of course but even the supporting cast who usually don't do to good, were great marky mark, leo, and matt damon were all pretty good. The Climax was awesome, the soundtrack was great, and this was actually better than the original chinese movie. it's rare that a remake kicks the originals ass but this is a good example. Great job marty.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-10-17","","RT","797717367"
