4.5,"I felt that the film worked very well as a good, intense, and interesting crime thriller. I thought that even though Leonardo DiCaprio and Matt Damon did fantastic jobs, it was Jack Nicholson that really made the movie work. He's so good at playing a nasty, racist, slimy, funny dude, and he totally nails it all down here. Some people may not be able to understand the plot very well if they don't pay attention, So i wouldn't recommend it to people who get distracted easily. Although i think that everyone will find something to like about this film. It's not my favorite Scorsese film(that would be TAXI DRIVER) but as far as his films go, this is one of his most entertaining. Check it out. It won the oscar!!! Whoopee!!! I personally liked LITTLE MISS SUNSHINE a bit more,, but this is still excellent cinematic fare.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-10-20","","RT","792828984"
