4.0,"Just another film in my collection of brilliantly priced DVDs, 
and once again it's a brilliant flick. 
I'm not usually a fan of Damon or DiCaprio, and I've not taken Mark Wahlberg seriously once due to his days with Marky Mark & the Funky Bunch. 
So why did I buy? 
3 Reasons really: 
1. It Stars the legendary Jack Nicholson, whom I have admired since his fantastic performance as the Joker, which I saw as a young lad. 
2. It's a Scorsese film. 
3. It's a remake of another fantastic film 'Infernal Affairs' (anyone who knows me can probably tell you I love world cinema). 
So I sat down to watching the film after it had sat gathering dust in my collection for the better part of 2 months. Admittedly I had a fear that I'd be disappointed, but this was not the case, much to my delight. 
Absolute theatrical genius was in front of my eyes for a quick 150 minutes of a particularly slow Sunday. 
If you like a movie with a great plot, or more importantly, a mob movie with a good plot AND great performances, look no further.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-10-29","","RT","798950609"
