4.0,"Everyone raved about this being the ""return to form"" for Scorsese and he finally won his, well overdue, Oscar. The story is that the head Irish mobster (played by Jack Nicholson) enlists the aid of Matt Damon (his son - kind of) before he graduates from cop school so that he can be his mole in the force. At about the same time, Charlie Sheen enlists Leo, just as he graduates, to go undercover and infiltrate Jack's mob. Eventually, the two undercover guys end up trying to discover who their opposite mole is. The movie is nicely paced with some strong characters. Jack is great as usual and Matt Damon continues to surprise me by being quite good. DiCaprio gives the best performance though which, I suppose, is why he won the Oscar.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-11-01","","RT","800509061"
