5.0,"I just loved this movie!  Course I like almost everything Martin Scorcese has done.  I'm so glad he finally won the Oscar for it (although by my count he should have already claimed an Oscar for: Raging Bull, Taxi Driver, and Goodfellas).  Anyway, I watched this on Movie Central which was a good thing because I often found myself pausing the movie just to soak up or understand a particular scene.  It was a pretty complex plot which is a good thing.  There were quite a few nail biting scenes (the one outside of the theatre where Leo's character was following Mark's was a really tense one).  I really thought Leo was excellent; how he could look and be so tense and stressed out.  I don't know how actors do that!  Loved the story, loved the score, just loved it!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-11-03","","RT","801090369"
