4.0,"For a remake, The Departed has an amazingly original feel and has nothing to be ashamed of when compared to the notorious director's previous work.

Scorsese's handprint is heavily present on this film, which perhaps isn't surprising as it is themed similarly to his most known work. Plot twists and double identities are numerous in this intelligent thriller. Jack Nicholson plays the monstrous gangster boss and Matt Damon and Leonardo DiCaprio struggle as his apprentices. Which one of the two young men turns out to be the real undercover cop is debatable.

Once again Scrosese has made some great picks of music to be played in scenes. Compared to his earlier work, The Departed has a more action film side to it, which is refreshing. The best quality about The Departed is in fact its freshness and the distance it has from Scrosese's earlier mob flicks without feeling foreign.

Excellent film!","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-11-05","","RT","799384490"
