4.0,"Who would ever think that this film is a masterpiece? Despite some ""adequate"" performances, the script doesn't gel and it plays like a soap opera in some parts. Scorsese, you are trying to hard again. Sure, it's stronger than Gangs of New York, but that doesn't mean that it should be ranked with Scorsese's masterworks. Scorsese needs to drop DiCaprio and find a new muse...hopefully their new collaboration wont last more than two hours...Scorsese, if you are going to make a film that has the length of an epic...then MAKE AN EPIC FILM!!! With that said, the movie is highly entertaining and has some slick style, and therefore deserves a B+. Anything highe than that, and your tastes needs a re-structuring...or you need to watch some more movies...or you just need to grow up and not get so goddamned excited by tings dat go boom boom and bad bad wurds and guns and stuff.....","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-11-09","","RT","794877573"
