2.5,"WOW... alot to get your head around here. the plots and sub-plots are so intermingled and subtle and it's definitely not the usual hollywood movie making i'm accustomed to where you can hear the words ""you will get this!!"" being screamed at you from the screen. it's not as good as goodfellas but goodfellas was never as complicated. i think scorsese genuinely made this to win an oscar and not for entertainment value. he's gone down in my favour with some of the flicks i've seen of his recently... such as one druel period drama i'd really like to wipe off of the face of the earth to save people some of their living time so they can go and watch a good film instead! all the main actors in this are on top of their form. maybe the three young chaps caught a bit of the O.T.T. bug from nicholson. it starts off slowly and by the time you're half way through scorsese turns the pressure up as the mole and the rat (sounds like animal farm) compete in a battle of wits for their lives. by the time you get to the last 45 minutes it's a violent more than half decently put together ending. altogether it is a good re-make but i just can't seem to decide whether i actually like it or not","",False,True,False,False,2.5,"2007-11-11","","RT","375193001"
