5.0,"Director Martin Scorsese finally gets his due in this Oscar Winning Cops and Robbers flick. With an all star cast like Nicholson, DiCaprio, and Damon, the movie is rife with talented acting. Combined with an interesting script, Departed pleases all.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-11-14","","RT","783144426"
5.0,"An absolute spellbinder from the greatest director in modern cinema, Martin Scorsese.  Brilliant performances all around from DiCaprio, Damon, Nicholson, Baldwin, Sheen, and an absolutely scene-stealing supporting role by Mark Wahlberg as Staff Sgt. Dignam.   Thie first time I saw this in the theater it grabbed me from the very first frame and 2 1/2 hours went by like 2 minutes.  I've watched it over and over since it was released on DVD and each time I seem to discover something new, some beautifully subtle plot point or clue that I didn't pick up on before.  This one, for me, is instantly slotted alongside ""Goodfellas"", ""Casino"", ""Taxi Driver"", and ""Raging Bull"" as his finest acheivements.  Some people say it didn't deserve the Best Picture and Best Director Oscar and got it because of all the previous times Scorsese has been snubbed. bit for my money I haven't seen a more compelling, entertaining, well acted and directed film in years.  Bravo.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-11-14","","RT","803242093"
