5.0,"If you knew what we did here we would not be good at our job, ""we would be cunts"", u callin us cunts? words spoken by mark walbergs scene stealer staff sgt. dignam in a film full of such great, salty quotes and amazing performances across the board, leonardo decaprio is especialy great in this film, proving himself to be the actor of his generation time and time again, most people gained new respect for him after this but seriously the guy has been an amazing actor for years, just check out whats eating gilbert grape, the basketball diaries or this boys life, really people stop underrating the guy. This is one of the greatest cop thrillers ever, and as a remake of a classic film of eastern cinema it's up there with the magnifcent seven (the seven samuri), a fistfull of dollars (yojimbo) and star wars (the hidden fortress, seriously it's the same film but in space) and it is only a hairs breath away from scorsese's absolute best, it seriously is just about up there with goodfellas, raging bull and taxi driver. One of the best films of the decade, and it proves that martin scorsese has still got it.","aa855df8-97f6-43f1-82dc-167bb68fcffd",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-11-14","","RT","790135380"
