4.5,"Crazy brilliant, but not actually Scorsese's best - we all know that, and that this was the film where the academy attempted to atone for its past sins.  That being said, this is one hell of a ride.  Dynamic, forceful, and epic cast, set into motion with the master's classic touches.  The best crime drama in a long time.  Needed to watch it a few times to take in all of the details, but I didn't mind a bit.  I relished the thought.  What a tour de force.  Finally, a movie that doesn't patronize the person watching it.  I thought these kind of action films were extinct.  It's good to be wrong.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-11-21","","RT","784926685"
