5.0,"There was a brief moment in time when Leo Di Caprio repeatedly lost against Jack Nicholson in Golden Globes and Oscars, and I was feeling his pain. Everyone was aware of Leo's talents, but they thought him too young to compete with a veteran.  Here, we see them working at their craft side by side, equally talented and evenly  matched. The cast is superb (Damon, Sheen, Baldwin, Anderson, Wahlberg) and the movie FACE OFF returns to me. Everyone one has  good side and a dark side. But, I try to remind myself that there is no good nor evil..just choices. And whichever choice you make, you'll eventually end up as one of the departed. Watch this film and learn more about the Irish. But I doubt you'll be able to tell the difference between Matt and Leo because they look too much alike.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2007-11-24","","RT","804555159"
