4.0,"If you want to see this movie, I approve, and here's why:  First, it's interesting throughout - the end of the movie crept up on me because it hadn't occurred to me to question the time.  And the story isn't transparent - we're allowed to see that some of the characters are lying, but are left questioning and suspicious of others.  And then there's a surprise - and it's a surprise that sets the film apart from most movies, so we're genuinely surprised.  And then there's the ending - which to me, although also surprising, was the weakest part of the movie.  Perhaps it's the lack of heroes.  So that's all I'm saying - surprise endings should stay that way, so go watch it.  :P~","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2007-12-07","","RT","784713617"
