2.5,"Probably the most overrated movie of 2006, The Departed tries to squeeze in too many generic elements for the sake of winning awards rather than to enhance the movie. Ironically, it tries to be realistic by tossing profanity in every other sentence, but in doing so in fact makes it unrealistic. Sorry Scorsese, but not everyone in the whole world speaks vulgarian, and that's not what makes a good script. At the end of the day, The Departed just leaves you wondering what was the point. Killing off all the main characters has also grown cliched in movies as of late. Oops, did I just ruin the ending for you? Good. Maybe you will skip watching this film then.","",False,False,False,False,2.5,"2007-12-13","","RT","806426899"
