3.5,"It might not be fair to judge this movie by comparing it to Infernal Affairs, the movie it was based off, rather than judging it on its own merits. Still, I can't help but do that. This version focuses more heavily on its main characters than its Hong Kong predecessor but the tense cops-and-criminals plotline is neglected. Some of the secondary characters that were used so effectively in the Hong Kong movie to both offer comic relief play the same role in terms of driving the plot but aren't fleshed out at all.

The result is a movie which allows us to say: Wow, Jack Nicholson / Leonardo DiCaprio / Mark Wahlberg / Martin Sheen / Matt Damon is a good actor! Which is good, but insufficient.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2007-12-17","","RT","784262818"
