4.5,"Violent. Gritty. Nasty. But oh-so-brilliant.

Superb acting all round, and another piece of great direction from Scorsese.

Heavy drama at its best when shared amongst an ensemble cast that delivers a great performance of a plausible script, though Nicholson doubtless steals the show as the merciless but endearing public enemy number one with some hallmark one-liners ('We all are... act accordingly!'

A superb piece, let down for me somewhat by an overly loud musical soundtrack which seemed to drown out some of the dialogue in scenes where a musical background wasn't necessary - perhaps the mix in the cinema I was in when I first saw it was off.

Region 2 DVD (from EV) is, as is usual for EV, awful - lacking definition and with terrible colour depth. Region 1 DVD solves the problem, and BluRay Region 2 is a big improvement on the S-DVD version, though still lacking when compared to the S-DVD Region 1.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2007-12-29","","RT","793502842"
