3.0,"'Tis a good movie, but I still can't understand why it had the impact it did. It was a double cat and mouse tail- and everyone always talks about how hot and original the plot is. . .never mind that it is a frame by frame adaptation of Internal Affairs.  I couldn't help but feel that this was another attempt at winning an Oscar by Scorsese. .. and yay for him- he succeeded, but this last decade, his movies have not left as big and impression on me as his earlier work did.  Whatever happened to Taxi Driver, and Raging Bull, Alice Doesn't Live Here Anymore. . .or even The Goodfellas? 
