5.0,"If the film is called ""The Departed"", then I wonder what it is about? You got that rhetorical question right? The name coupled with the poster explains everything you need to know before stepping into the theater. So why then, is every other person getting their bits in a knot because of the ending? I don't understand it.

Anyways, this film is incredible. It's definitely not Scorsese's best but flip, it comes close. The man redefined a genre, he made us all fall in love with Jack Nicholson again (like that's even possible) and he fooled everyone into thinking that (SPOILER) the protagonists were going to die in their sleep (despite the clues on the poster. Gosh). Seriously, what a genius. This film breathes tension, it seeps out liters of dirty and entertaining conflict. Could one ask for any else in a film about truth, lies and deception? I think not. Wait there is something else. An awesome single that makes us want to get pissed, wave pints about and beat everyone up? Nevermind, that's in there as well.

The Departed is everything you want to experience when sitting down to be entertained. Not only (for once) do get what you expect to get, but you get that a little bit of Pink Floyd thrown in. Is there anything missing from this?","c81c9ecb-ae05-4a35-8247-f8c5e241b3f6",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-03-15","","RT","818274849"
