4.0,"A remake/ re imaging of Hong Kong's Infernal Affairs,  The Departed is one of my favourite Martin Scorsese  films.  Again I will avoid any spoilers here.  This film takes place in Boston where Irish Mob boss Francis ""Frank"" Costello plants Colin Sullivan as an informant within the Massachusetts State Police. Simultaneously, the police assign undercover cop William Costigan to infiltrate Costello's crew. When both sides of the law realize the situation, each man attempts to discover the other's true identity before being found out.  The Departed is a great thriller with some of the best performances to date from Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon and Jack Nicholson.  But for me a stand out performance from Mark Wahlberg.  Check out the original three films if you can.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2008-04-06","","RT","820133349"
