5.0,"A wonderful film. Great story skillfully scripted, an eclectic cast suited perfectly to their character, and a prolific director once again at the top of his profession. There's not a dull moment in this film. There's acts of violence throughout, as you'd expect from the maker of Goodfellas and Raging Bull (among so many others) but the film's not gratuitous at all. The twisted and ingenious story, although appears initially contrived, is heavily based reality. The actors bring depth and believeability to the charactors and Scorsese, the director, in turn tells the story exquisitely. One other mention; Scorsese's long time editor brings her usual high standard along for a finely made mafia story.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-04-16","","RT","819600658"
