5.0,"Fact: This was based on a Hong Kong movie script, and when i say based on, i'm not just talking about similarities in scenes and characters, i'm talking about full-fledge renactment of scenes with almost exact art direction, wholly translated dialogues, and total mimicking cinematography. Yes, it's that exact.
That being said, it's a very Scorsese-styled flick with all the Scorsese trademarks of gripping tension, intense characters and hard violence, which is the only reason it's deserving of a top-rating. Commendable acting on all, edited in perfection. But i shall not give credit to its masterful plot, because it was never his in the first place.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-04-21","","RT","813000960"
