4.0,"While this is not my favorite Scorsese film, it is a really good one.  Which isn't saying much, because he makes really good movies consistently.  Still, the movie maintains a certain degree of tension that makes you want to watch it all.  In combination, the film is constructed so you feel for the characters, which is something that is often missing entirely in movies with the tension I just mentioned.

My biggest complaint is that the film is like one gigantic sausage party.  I really refuse to admit that all these menZ are doing all these things without any women backing them up at home.  It just doesn't seem right.","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2008-05-21","","RT","825886157"
