5.0,"This is one of those very rare films where you know it is going to last for just under 3 hours and think that you don't have time to watch it, but then when you do start, you just don't want it to end. This is without doubt the best film I have seen recently (if you read my reviews then you know I like my movies). The Departed has the best assembled cast since LA Confidential. God knows how much they spent, but it was worth it. The acting was second to none, Jack was his amazing self, Martin Sheen was brilliant and Leo and Matt were fantastic on screen together (sounds a little gay, but fuck it, its true). Scorsese never disappoints and I was surprised to see that Brad Pitt also co-produced the film too. You need to see this, and although it is a remake of the fantastic Infernal Affairs, it is a rare remake that is so much better than the original. If I had one negative comment it would be Ray Winstone's ever changing cockney/Amercian accent, but that is me nit-picking. A true classic and will be for a long long time. Excellent stuff..!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-05-22","","RT","818786754"
