5.0,"Director has this tough name to read right - and I'm not even talking bout pronouncing. Luckily it doesn't affect the movie, which is a total masterpiece. Usually I don't like movies of this genre, but this was absolutely glorious. There are some big names in it, DiCaprio and Nicholson.. Matt Damon and all of them do an amazing job. Nicholson is in his natural element as a badass gentleman, Damon is acting as intelligent police who is rocketing up with his career and DiCaprio is.. well, see for yourself. And who is that lovely lady who succeeds in mixing words sexy and beautiful? I've always thought that's an impossibility. But I was wrong: she is in the same category with Jennifer Connelly, though the latter is still way better actress in my opinion. Plot is deliciously complex and has some twists in it. And when you think it's finally over... it's not.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-06-06","","RT","800633593"
