5.0,"To say that ""The Departed"" is brilliant does not even come close to describing this amazing movie. Legendary director Martin Scorsese has crafted a truly gripping film; one that keeps you on the edge of your seat from the very first scene and never lets up. Excellent performances from the entire cast, but it's Leonardo DiCaprio that really steals the show. In the past, he has been relegated to ""pretty boy"" status, but he proves here that he truly is an acting force to be reckoned wtih. Due to its content, this is a very difficult movie to watch at times, with its highly vulgar language and scenes of intense violence. However, the story and acting are both so powerful that you can't help but love this movie, despite its rough content. Highly recommended.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-06-25","","RT","799691136"
