Part 3 - The conclusion.

The ending wasn't just shoot and die. ><","",False,False,False,False,1.0,"2008-06-25","","RT","806456530"
5.0,"[color=black]Best damn film I've seen in ages, about time and all. Fast pace, quality acting and an exciting storyline. Martin Scoreses' finest film since Goodfellas, its absolutely brilliant.[/color]
[color=#000000]Two moles in opposite sides but the each side wants to know... who is the mole in their organisation? Its very edgy and quite dark.[/color]
[color=#000000]Leornado Di Caprio is great as the nervous double agent who seems to be ripped apart anytime soon and Mark Walberg is also exceptional at being the prickly detective with a fiery temper and manners to match Gregory House. Jack Nicholson is excellent as the boss of the Irish Mob Gang, Frank Costello, hes back at his scariest.[/color]
[color=#000000]There are so many great scenes to make this a classic.  [/color]","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-06-25","","RT","901104686"
