3.5,"I feel bad seeing a remake before the original. But this was pretty awesome. If only Scorsese would stop ripping off my movies. I used 'Let it Loose' by the Stones in a movie like four years before him. And his obsession with cell-phones as plot devices is clearly influenced by my filmography. Ah well, at least he steals from the best. :)","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2008-07-05","","RT","782375458"
5.0,"An instant classic and easily the greatest remake of a foreign film ever made. I personally believe that it is a better film than Infernal Affairs (which is my favourite foreign language film) but not by much.

