4.5,"The Departed is a fantastic, intelligent thriller from Scorsese.
I'd been hearing a lot of good things about this film for months so my expectations were fairly high before I watched it.
Thankfully, those expectations were met. In some ways exceeded.
There are a couple of things people need to know about The Departed. One, is that it is a Scorsese film, therefore it is very unique in terms of how the story is told so it can take a little getting used to and may not simply appeal to a lot of people.
Two, is that, in my opinion, the film gets off to a slow start, but you shouldn't let that put you off because it's about to get very exciting very quickly!
There are a few things I loved about The Departed. The writing is brilliant and very clever, all of the characters are believable and portrayed intensely and the directing is brilliantly unique.
All of the actors in the film are fantastic and it's impossible really to pick out one great performance due to them all being so great!
Overall, The Departed is a fantastic film that should keep you on the edge of your seat all the way through, especially during the last half hour!
A must see for anyone who loves action and gripping drama!","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2008-07-08","","RT","155430282"
