4.0,"LEO DE CAPRIO IS AWEESOOMMEEE","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2008-07-22","","RT","833183555"
5.0,"<div style=""width:2100px;""><a href=""http://www.flixster.com/actor/leonardo-di-caprio/photos?p=10430516""><img src=""http://content6.flixster.com/photo/10/43/05/10430516_gal.jpg"" border=""0""/></a><div style=""text-align:center;font-size:10px;""><a href=""http://www.flixster.com"">Flixster</a> - Share Movies</div></div> 

The Departed is a gritty crime/drama about South Boston police force who are closing in on the Mafia leaded by Frank Costello (Jack Nicholson). The only way the police can take Frank's mob down is one undercover cop named Billy Costigan (Leonardo Dicaprio) who has to get inside & find out just exactly what Frank & his men are up too. As Billy is undercover with Frank, Frank has a rat named Colin Sullivan (Matt Damon) who helps Frank escape in stuations where the other police officers don't know about. As all this goes on, things get deeper with Billy & Colin as they collide with one another's identity's where they become in danger to the enemy. Now Billy & Colin is in a life or death situation where one of them has to come clean before the other one gets caught. 

This is one of the best drama crime & gangster moves to date. I enjoyed every minute of this movie. It has an amazing cast who all do very well especially Leonardo Dicaprio. I tell ya Leo might still be young actor but he is one of the youngest rising actors out there. He was brillant just like Mark Wahlberg, Matt Damon, Jack Nicolson & the rest of the cast on screen as well. I watched this movie almost everyday because its so entertaining & i never get bored watching it. I recommend for who hasnt seen this film yet to go out & buy it. Its worth every penny trust me. 

