4.5,"Gangster specialist Scorsese was finally able to clutch a Best Director Academy Award in his palms for this sweat-and-tears crime epic about an undercover police agent (Dicaprio) that is willing to risk life and limb to take down an eccentric crime lord (Nicholson). While blood is shed in the Massachusetts Police Department, a corrupt accomplice (Damon) of the bizarre criminal peers into the officers' secrets and serves them on a silver platter to the mob. Expert villain actor Nicholson is on the very edge of delivering yet another ruthless over-the-top performance, but luckily the eccentricity of his character never goes too overboard, even though it should at times. A few too many needless subplots, including a steamy love triangle between Damon, Damon, and Ferminga, but it's created a formula of its own, which pits it against the 2003 Hong Kong versions. And last, but certainly not least, a few twists are added to the ending that will practically throttle your neck.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2008-07-27","","RT","828233090"
