4.5,"Violent in the extreme, but never in the cheap Tarrentino way, The Departed is a long film that doesn't drag at all.  Even when the full 150mins are up, you'll want more.

This is a truly powerful movie packed with top actors all turning in some of their best performances, so much so that none of them could be singled out above the others.

More than anything I loved this because it dared not to be formulaic, at a time when everything was sticking to tired, predictable patterns.

Just try not to read the muppet reviewers who give away the films final twist!

Top entertainment that will keep you guessing and enthralled to the end.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2008-09-05","","RT","830810443"
