5.0,"Ok so heres the deal if you have never seen a Scorsese picture in your entire life your missing out on an incredible artist.  Damon, DiCaprio, Wallburg, and the one and only Jack Nicholson Star in the hit movie ""The Departed"".  Now I understand not many people know about this movie.  It has come to my understanding that this was Di Caprio's second movie with Martin Scorsese.  Matt Damon on the other hand has not been in a Scorsese picture.  The two collide like crazy in this movie.  They back in forth almost as if competing for something.  Many people saw it as Di Caprio vs. Damon.  The movie will fill you with tension and emotion beyond your wildest dreams.  And for all you comedy fans out there, if you thought Nicholson was a funny nut job, u better rethink that after you watch Martin Scorsese's The Departed.  If you don't have it then get to your local blockbuster or video store.  I promise you won't be dissapointed with this movie.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-11-01","","RT","832484101"
