4.5,"The Departed is a star-studded film that features both an intricate story and phenominal performances from it's cast. 
(In fact, an oscar nomination for Leonardo DiCAPRIO)
 
Though the film may not focus much on it's humanity or the human side of things, it does a tremendous job of portraying the gritty realism of criminal life, and features a plot that has it's characters surviving solely on the fragile balance of power between the police and the underground elements. When that balance is disturbed, you can expect to see things spiral out of control toward a mind-blowing finale that will not allow you to simply move on to another film. After watching The Departed, your expectations for movies will undoubtably rise dramatically.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2008-11-16","","RT","901200148"
