5.0,"This is one of the best undercover cop movies I have ever seen. Di Caprio really does it here! He not only is totally convincing, he gives us the gut wrenching feelings of being right in the scorpions nest, day in and day out, living the double life of good guy & bad guy, undercover hero and dirty rat with the threat of discovery constantly hanging over him and the frustration of powerlessness. Matt Damon, Mark Wahlberg and Jack Nicholson together with Leonardo DiCaprio in what I think is his best roll ever, form a most solid and entertaining group in this movie. A thriller from start to finish, great story, great directing by Martin Scorsese, great soundtrack and what a finish! Not for the fainthearted, the graphic violence really hits home to help make this is really a great movie. Too bad I bought the DVD before I got my Blu Ray.","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-11-21","","RT","840849243"
