5.0,"This movie is great... and I don't even know why!! I turned it off half way through and couldn't get an erection for days! But for some reason this movie is a resounding success with the dull sterile masses; and ME TOO! All those sexy ""Slow-Mo"" shots. That HOTTT MATT DAMON! AWWWWW, sorry :(  I Came. Those frenetic montages edited to the music of a band who are as energetic and relevant today as Martin Scorsese was... 30 years ago! It captures the true grit of the Bostonian city life better than anyone since Henry James, even though almost the entirety of the movie was filmed in New York (probably to excape the Taxman!) I'm at the end now and I still don't know why I'm letting every idiot's POV reflect onto my personal taste and allow me to Love this movie so so much. Yet alas, I do love it. Next wut? Perhaps a decent self mocking wine/champagne commercial, and then a shitty ""live"" Rolling Stones documentary. You keep on truckin' Marty!","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-11-23","","RT","786662369"
