3.5,"I've always held off reviewing this movie because I wanted to watch it a few more times to really take it in. I have not seen Infernal Affairs, and I'm therefore looking at it by its own merit.Truthfully, I think the film is overhyped and far too many people were worried about Marty getting his oscar, than judging this movie fairly, me being one of them. The Departed is a solid movie, but it is heavily flawed, not so much in its story, but in its production. I try not be a snob when it comes to film, but the shoddiness of the editing, sound, music and general production value is distracting. It's as if he got a bunch of college students fresh out of film school to work the post-production. And the little game he plays with the X's, childish. I appriciate everything Martin Scorsese has done for film, but this movie is not a part of that legacy.
I enjoy The Departed but I withdrawl my opinion that this is an epic American film, it's simply average.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2008-11-30","","RT","782637817"
