5.0,"Scorsese's the Departed is the perfect Boston gangster movie. Based loosely of the real story of Whitey Bulger, it goes above and beyond the norm of a gangster movie. I think DiCaprio is the one who makes this movie the way it is, his nervous, on-the-edge acting perfectly portrays what it is like to be a UC. Scorsese's direction was differently worth the Oscar he received, he made it flow so naturally and it came together at the end better than any movie I have seen. The ending will take you emotions be surprise and before you can react, your emotions will be conflicting with a surprising and feel good end. This movie will go down as a raw work of art in its own category.","55c37723-3c1e-4fd9-a8dc-0f86af240488",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2008-12-17","","RT","901183527"
