3.5,"Oh, the f-words. That's what brought this movie down for me. What I've determined lately is that writers resort to the f-word when they're not creative (or intelligent) enough to come up with anything better. That or they're desperate for an R rating, which they would've gotten anyway.

Anyway. Other than that, this movie is really good. The plot is full of twists, and while it's confusing, it makes sense in the end, and all the double agent points are fun to watch. The action is amazing (that scene toward the end on the roof and in the elevator was, while bloody, very suspenseful). The acting, while they're not spouting out f-words (but I covered that already), is nearly flawless. They did a good job casting. Although, the moral message at the end was a bit...depressing, to say the least. Overall, worth a watch, if you can handle it; note: it's not for the squeamish.","",False,False,False,False,3.5,"2008-12-30","","RT","825677778"
