4.0,"i've not caught the hong kong version of this and thus i'll be in no position to make any comparisons of this remake to the orignal.
having said that, i believe this to be a good show. like a game of cat and mouse/hide and seek, good cop face off bad cop, both trying to unravel each other's identities; the concept is intriguing if not cliche, however great acting on the part of the stellar cast makes this a flick to reckon with. this show promises lots of action and thrills and it delivers but falls short in being thought provoking( as i came to expect when 2 guys try to out smart each other).
the ending is incredible if i may say(spoiler alert), very unlike the orthodox coclusion of good guy wins bad guy dies; here, within the last 10mins of the show ending, all major characters meet their demise under unexpected circumstances, baddie murders bad-guy boss, some toon kills tbe protagonist, the next second good cop dies. then as if to put the the cherry on the top, the antagonist joins the departed after being shot in his home be some deranged ex-colleague(you watch the show you'd know why).
in all, 4 stars-- think i'll go watch it again","",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2009-02-08","","RT","3465693"
