1.5,"""When I was your age they would say we can become cops, or criminals. Today, what I'm saying to you is this: when you're facing a loaded gun, what's the difference?""

2/10

Once again, Hollywood takes a good story and ruins it with poor crafting. Very bad casting, a rushed and unfulfilling ending, overuse of profanity, not enough character substance, one dimensional players and an insult to the viewers intelligence.

Not only is this a remake, it is a poor one at that.  The real problem with The Departed is that it feels like a movie that any director could have came along and made.  A Scorsese film should showcase something that only Scorsese himself could pull off, this isn't it.  Make it long, add top star billing, and spend a zillion dollars, and I guess anything can receive an award. Silly me, I thought original, provocative, and at the very least, plausible story telling was needed for good drama.

The Departed is by far one of Scorsese's weakest films.","",False,False,False,False,1.5,"2009-02-21","","RT","850388335"
