4.5,"Scorsese weaves a tangled web of deception at is both nuanced and layered.  The Departed tells the tale of two cops; one undercover for the mob and the other undercover in the mob.  Their stories parallel and intertwine to a satisfying climax.  Not for the faint of heart, this movie is plenty violent.  But passage through these scenes rewards its viewers with insight to the character's motivation and vulnerability.  It's Scorsese's best film since Good Fellas.","",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2009-03-01","","RT","843095933"
