5.0,"Fantastic gangster film starring Leo DiCaprio, Matt Damon and Jack Nicholson. Mob boss Frank Costello (Jack Nicholson) continues a reign of crime in Boston but the cops send in an undercover agent Costigan(Leonardo DiCaprio) into his gang in secret in an attempt to uncover information on him so they can make his arrest. Meanwhile Costello has his own mole hidden inside the police department Sgt Sullivan (Matt Damon), a man who everybody trusts and nobody suspects keeping him out of handcuffs! With each side trying to defeat the other and smoke out their rat who will win the war? This slick and superbly directed film by Martin Scorcese is terrific with fantastic performances by all the cast! Unmissable!","b593f0ca-e56a-4e05-99ed-9d47e0275849",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-03-27","","RT","822265009"
