5.0,"Boston, Massachusetts. Home of the Red Sox, Irish Americans and Harvard. It's also the setting for Martin Scorsese's masterpiece, and Oscar drought-breaker. Leo DiCaprio, Matt Damon and Mark Walhberg prove they can hold their own against the likes of Alec Baldwin, Martin Sheen and the incomparable Jack Nicholson. Each actor gives the performance of a lifetime as good cops, bad cops, good crooks and bad crooks. Murders are committed and alliegences are tested as we witness a local gangland killer work his way into the special investigation unit of the Boston PD, and a rookie cop going undercover to take his place. It's intricate, it's gritty, it's shocking, and it's an action flick that just doesn't let up","",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-03-29","","RT","857046617"
