4.5,"Superb crime drama from the master director, thanks to a pitch perfect cast and excellent adapting of the source material.  The acting across the board is brilliant, with Di Caprio & Damon giving career best lead performances while Jack Nicholson is menacing as the sinister mob boss ruling both their lives.  The scene stealer, though, is Mark Wahlberg as a foul mouthed sergeant.  Behind the camera, Scorsese delivers another superb crime drama, expertly adapting ""Infernal Affaris"" to a Boston setting, delivering plenty of twists and turns, along with some thrilling sequences.  All in all, while Scorsese has made better films like ""Raging Bull"" and ""GoodFellas"", this a darn good one showing him at the peak of his powers.","27ad1012-07da-42d1-b3da-be585bcee2af",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2009-05-26","johnathon w","RT","158f8844-ee1c-4b07-8a2d-e24064693a2c"
