5.0,"Another crime classic from legendary filmmaker Martin Scorsese. The Departed is a highly compelling and suspenseful thriller with exceptional performances from everyone. It tells the story of Billy Costigan and Colin Sullivan, two men from opposite sides of the law who are both undercover within the Massachusetts State Police and the Irish mafia. When discoveries are made, violence ensues and the two mole's come closer to discovering each other's true identities. Leonardo DiCaprio is superb and Matt Damon is extraordinary. Jack Nicholson is of course mesmerizing and Mark Wahlberg is sensational. This film is so well acted and brilliantly made. Its a masterpiece and one of the greatest films I have ever seen. Its not Scorsese best, but it comes extremely close.

The Departed is a film that literally took my breath away. Its constantly gripping and is never boring. Martin Scorsese is a masterful filmmaker who simply does not know how to make a bad film. He is a genius and my favorite director. This film is an American classic. The Departed is spectacular.","9d1ad46c-d2c8-4548-aad4-90fe9dc0416d",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-06-11","","RT","870808683"
