5.0,"Martin Scorcese's Oscar-winning masterpiece about a young cop, played by Leonardo DiCaprio, who goes deep undercover in the Irish mob in South Boston, and a young criminal, played by Matt Damon, who goes undercover as a mole in the very unit of the police department that is out to take down his mob boss, played brilliantly by Jack Nicholson.  A remake of the excellent Hong Kong thriller 'Infernal Affairs', 'The Departed', also starring Mark Wahlberg and Martin Sheen, is a symphony of violence, vulgarity, and suspense.","80e96528-ad21-431d-a211-f10d71ec6512",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-06-26","","RT","872319077"
