5.0,"One of the best Criminal Gangster films ever! A grand visual and perfectly written masterpiece! The characters, all the characters develop with great pace and we care about these characters throughout this film but they sometimes do out of character things, but only minor. The action scenes are well done as well as the cinematography, lighting and colors that are put into this film are done marvelously. The writing is well done as well as the plot going at a nice pace and showing the two sides of the rats one in the police and gangs, a very well done and great situations being put into the movie as the story develops and grows into a large complex subplot story. Overall I love this movie, it is very well done and deserves all the praise it gets. A Masterpiece!","6ad8b92b-5130-4a37-bd03-5cfda0e73a7c",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-07-27","","RT","841787412"
