5.0,"This movie is awesome.  There's really no other way to put it.  It is one of my favorite movies ever or possibly THE favorite movie of mine.  The plot of this movie is perfect.  With both Leo DiCaprio's character and Matt Damon's characters being double agents on each side of a crime war, it makes for some great suspense.  It will also keep you guessing until the very end on how the movie will turn out.  The acting is spot on.  You definitely believe Jack Nicholson is a crime lord, Matt Damon is a Massachusetts state trooper/mole for the mob, and Mark Wahlberg is badass.  Speaking of Mark Wahlberg, if you want some humor, he and Alec Baldwin's quick banter is definitely worth seeing.  Overall, I can't think of any way for this movie to be better so I would definitely recommend seeing it.","d83ebfb1-1568-4b9d-b21d-e68f8ed31d4b",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-08-09","","RT","901299083"
