5.0,"The Departed is one of the greatest mob films ever. It's up there with The Godfather, Goodfellas, etc. The movie is violent, gritty, and down to earth. The acting is sharp. Leonardo DiCaprio shines in this film, and Matt Damon and Jack Nicholson are outstanding in this film. The plot is excellent and suspenseful, and it will keep you guessing until the bitter end. Uses of symbolism and perfectly-executed dialogue are thrown into the mix, adding to the appeal of this movie. Scorsese is a master in film making. His vision is solid and flawless. He creates an engaging narrative, fueled by intrigue and bloody violence that's an addicting concoction for a great gangster movie. And it's one of his best films yet.","de02c6f6-fcdb-4a8d-9350-262153a742a6",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-08-28","","RT","901269445"
