4.5,"Wow, this movie was amazing. The acting was amazing, especially, in my opinion, by Leonardo DiCaprio. Why did he not get an Academy Award for this? I did not like Jack Nicholson that much though. His acting confused me. At one moment he seems like he's cool, and then the next moment, he acts like he's drunk or something. But whatever, he was good too. The story was great. The movie was a little long though, but the movie makes up for it with continually superb acting and story throughout. The only thing I did not like about this movie was the ending. It was suprising, I have to give it that. But, I did not like that, to wrap the movie up, the movie just basically kills all of the main characters. If you haven't seen the movie yet and I spoiled it for you, I'm sorry, but I think that this had to be said. Overall though, great movie. Definitely worth a watch.","d2641b08-d137-43e7-a19e-2ac10672d657",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2009-09-14","","RT","901269434"
