4.5,"This Violent Oscar-Winning Gangster Epic already has my favorite ending to a movie of all time. I truly think it deserved more than 5 Oscar nominations, I think Matt Damon, Leonardo DiCaprio, Jack Nicholson, Martin Sheen and Alec Baldwin at least should have received a nomination in either the Oscars, BAFTAs, Golden Globes, MTV Movie Awards Local Critics awards etc. This is arguably the first movie that made me think hard and had me thrilled throughout. So it's 5 down 5 to go to watch all the Best Picture winners of the 2000s!","2c7e5fef-2c5f-4c71-bd34-33920f6e9aeb",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2009-09-28","","RT","888600296"
