5.0,"one of the best movies if not the best movie i have ever seen.","a0869ece-5780-4957-9227-2a3f3ccaf2a5",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-09-29","","RT","901317640"
4.5,"The Departed easily could have been another one of those crime dramas where there is a mindless villain seemingly without a single motivation, pursued by cops with perfect records who don't flinch in the face of danger. Fortunately, The Departed isn't even close to being one of those movies. It has characters that are original, complicated, and, most importantly, interesting. There's Jack Nicholson as the crime boss, Matt Damon as his mole, and Leonardo DiCaprio as the state police's undercover agent. What ensues is a classic mix of action, conspiracy and raw emotion. Martin Scorsese's wonderful movie is one of the best crime movies I've ever seen, and is a worthy Best Picture winner.

Plot: 28/30
Lead acting: 20/20
Supporting acting: 15/15
Look/Effects: 14/15
Cohesiveness: 8/10
Nuances: 9/10

Total: 94%","090e737b-5a36-4b91-9760-22cb1fc9d682",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2009-09-29","","RT","901162830"
