5.0,"This is a rather late review and I am sure nearly everyone has seen it. If you are one that haven't I am sort of jealous of you, because you get a chance to watch for the first time one of the greatest movies of all time from one of the best directors of all time.

The Departed is Martin Scorsese's best work since Goodfellas in 1990. I have seen The Departed ruffly 20 times now (couldn't change the channel whenever it showed on HBO). Being able to watch and continue to enjoy a movie that many times is saying so much to the quality of this movie. From the strong multi angled script to the world class director and all star cast of actors, The Departed is the best cop thriller of ALL TIME. 

There is absolutely nothing negative I can say about this movie. DiCaprio and Nicholson give award winning performances. The plot is so thick and well done, that even after the 15th time watching it, I discovered something new that I didn't notice the previous 14 times.

I'm not even going to continue with this review. I've said all that needs to be said from my writing ability. Nothing I am capable of expressing will be able to describe how truly amazing this movie is. It is a masterpiece. So rare are we presented with such works of art, it makes me rather sad to think about it. 

If I could give this movie a 110% fresh tomato rating, I would have. It would be deserved.","cee455e2-b866-400f-af7b-fd8d6539a7f1",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-11-12","","RT","901333117"
