5.0,"Recently, I have bumped into movies I love but have one weakness or the other. However, all those movies, I gave a 10/10. The Departed is no exception. Its incredibly complex, thrilling, and absorbing. The film is not engaging during the first 50 minutes and gets confusing but it is so well made in the middle that I couldn't bring myself to rate this movie less than 10. Its not an action movie but rather crime with very less action. It even has an emotional touch. I am not a scorcese fan cause I believe he should make more movies for the audiences than the critics just like Spielberg my favourite director who gives entertainment, emotions, special effects, and complexity.","30e2967c-6d10-4300-ab8b-517881433afc",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-12-19","","RT","901277329"
