5.0,"I'll start this one off with saying that I am fully aware that this was released in 2006, but I've always wanted to review it. I've probably seen this movie at least 10 times, and I'll still watch it..again..again..and again. I found it to be THAT good. Everything about this movie is almost perfect. The superb acting by... an all-star cast, the action, suspense, and one of the best story lines EVER in my opinion. The dialogue is excellent here, leaving you with some memorable quotes. You definitely have to pay attention in this one due to pace at which the story goes, but this shouldn't be an issue. Some of the best surprises I've seen in a movie also. If you have not seen this already, don't bother renting it, just buy it!","5596b3e9-163f-4893-bc92-2c7c742af9fe",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2009-12-23","","RT","895963934"
