5.0,"When I first saw this film I don't think any other director could have told this story better. The Departed is an amazing picture about corruption, betrayle, machoistic men, violence, and cell phones. Martin Scorsese told a very interesting story about the inner circles of how people can be nice on the outside but very malicious on the inside. When I was watching The Departed everybody is guilty one way or another as much as for the redemption side? well I guess that would be Billy Costigan played by Leo DiCaprio giving all the info he's got as an informant to Madolyn played by Vera Farmiga. Billy is Madolyn's salvation.","54876c40-3e41-45a6-be46-5d3f2226bd54",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-01-02","","RT","893793272"
