4.0,"Another brilliant crime film from the great Martin Scorsese! What's amazing about this film is that as you keep watching the film it just gets unbelievably better. As violent as it is, as harsh a film as it is, the story just grasps your breath and does not let go! A faithful remake of the Hong Kong: ""Infernal Affairs"", what makes this remake work is not because it is just a duplicate of the original, but the spirit of the original dwells in this film with a twist of American culture to it. Scorsese directs this wonderfully, taking the original a step further with respect to it. What's also great in this film is the ensemble of the cast which I can only is near perfection, each actor bringing out his best to make this film work extraordinarily!","e8d5a85b-92e2-46c5-be84-4c19718e1b49",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2010-01-02","","RT","796539912"
