4.0,"I haven't seen the Infernal Affairs series, which this movie is based on. I liked what I saw, up until the ending. Overall, it was a fantastic movie, with a great premise of two spies infiltrating each others' groups, and some very creative execution. The characters were very intriguing, well acted, and the movie had great use of fast editing (most movies can't pull it off). The ending, however, was simply offensive in its abruptness and lack of creativity. It was a contender for five stars before the ending.","06e134f6-7a1b-4b77-be65-b9b6249aaed6",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2010-01-04","","RT","896658599"
