5.0,"This...This movie...The Departed...this is the movie where I became one of the biggest fans of Martin Scorsese. The movie that finally gave Martin Scorsese his Best Director oscar, which he should have gotten back in 1980.

This is the first review of many reviews that I will write about a Scorsese movie.

The Departed is a true crime classic. It's got one of the best acting ensemble in a movie! Leonardo DiCaprio, Jack Nicohlson, Matt Damon, Mark Walhberg, Martin Sheen, and Alec Baldwin. When you have all of these actors in one film, you know you got a masterpiece right before your eyes.

The story is top notch by William Monahan. The violence is gritty and brutal as always in a Scorsese film. The Departed ranks right up with Scorsese's other masterpieces, such as GoodFellas, Mean Streets, Gangs of New York, Raging Bull, Taxi Driver...

This is most definately ranked on my top favorite films of all time. Every time I watch it, it never gets old.","68445896-59f7-45d6-a539-91775634ec2e",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-02-09","","RT","901332256"
