5.0,"Unequivocally my favorite movie of all-time. First off, this is a remake of a Chinese film, but one that trumps virtually any remake ever done. It's very familiarly based on James ""Whitey"" Bulger and his gang in the Boston area back in the mid to late 1900s. The cast is amazing with Damon, DiCaprio, Nicholson, Wahlberg, Sheen, Baldwin, and Farmiga. DiCaprio validated himself as Scorcese's successor to De Niro with this film. He was great in The Aviator and solid in Gangs of New York, but this film really established his acting versatility. I'd only give about 3 or 4 films a 100% rating and this is certainly one of them.","07384546-7368-4d46-8826-ba70ef71dd04",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-02-19","","RT","901380265"
