5.0,"The Departed has enough tension to keep you engrossed, and enough color for ten crime pictures. Scorsese obviously adores his expensive, expansive ensemble. An American Crime Classic. I can say with out a doubt that The Departed is one of the best films of 2006, An excellent movie. A relentless, hard- boiled and engaging crime-thriller. A piercing bullet of excitement and head bashing fun. It's sizzling, crackling, intelligent, and breathtaking. It's tension-loaded and adrenaline-pumping from beginning to end. An instant classic. Director, Martian Scorsese's masterpiece. A powerful, riveting and explosive film. A total powerhouse. It's just simply awesome. It's remarkable, enjoyable and sensational. Stylish, slick, brutal, wickedly funny and magnificent.","35b6ab72-a71c-4bff-a1d3-fa29cda17249",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-02-28","","RT","899176296"
