5.0,"Martin Scorsese never ceases to stop making amazing movies. The Departed is a rough, gritty, and engrossing labyrinthe of gangsters, cops, and informants. The star-studded cast is staggering featuring some great performances from Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, Leonardo DiCaprio, Mark Wahlberg, Martin Sheen, Alec Baldwin, and the list goes on. It is  the story of two rats who relay information between Boston's finest and Nicholson's Irish gang with one on either side of the thin blue line. Nicholson is a standout (as always) but DiCaprio and Damon both do extraordinary work but truthfully Wahlberg's turn at the end (sorry, no spoilers) makes him just as good. Pumped with plenty of surveillance, chases, smoking guns, standoffs, fist fights, questioned loyalties,  and Boston accents, The Departed is (in my opinion) one of Scorsese's finest and one of the standout films of the decade.","f57d299a-e769-4208-a96d-215095bdfd00",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-03-03","","RT","901382568"
