4.5,"Though its impact has worn off over time, ""The Departed is still among Martin Scorsese's best pictures. For one thing, it's not a bloated historical epic, nor is it set outside the filmmaker's comfort zone of crime, family, blood, and redemption.

The performances by the leads (Matt Damon, Leonardo Di Caprio, and Vera Farmiga) are hit-or-miss, but this flaw is compensated for by a sterling supporting cast, especially excellent turns from Mark Wahlberg and Martin Sheen as the leaders of the cops and Ray Winstone as a lieutenant of a group of criminals overseen by Frank Costello (Jack Nicholson).","7201cc64-baa9-4ed5-a2db-ea2b4f6db732",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2010-03-19","","RT","782689724"
