5.0,"One of Scorsese's greatest films. The Departed is a modern masterpiece built on a gritty storyline that is very intriguing and deceptive. The film is very cat and mouse which is awesome. This film features and ensemble cast that truly carries and delvers the film. Leonardo DiCaprio gives one of his greatest performances as Billy Costigan, a cop who infiltrates the Irish Mob. Matt Damon is great as Colin Sullivan a cop who works for the Irish mob boss, Jack Nicholson in one great performance. Mark Wahlberg also gives his best performance as Staff Sergeant Dignam. This film is a tough, dark crime film that is very climatic with many twists and turns with a shocking ending.","225a8d34-1fa2-44eb-a0ec-dec3d3439597",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-03-21","","RT","882104177"
