Anyways, HOLY CRAP!!
How did I miss out on this one??? This movie is simply a delicious masterpiece that combines action, drama and bits of street noir added with awesome, powerful performances by Leo DiCaprio, Jack Nicholson and Matt Damon. Damon's role was low-key compared to his performances in Bourne and Green Zone, but he makes the perfect police mole. Leo gave an all-out pitch-perfect performance. Jack Nicholson was badass right into his own end that was caused by Damon. This scene is a masterstroke.
