 * 'You don't have any cats. I like that.'    One very effective line...;)
 * Then ending gave me the same feeling as 'Memento'. Though there is nothing funny, I was feeling like I've just seen a comedy. Maybe it's because of the psychological relief. Your mind stops for a second and you...remain  speechless. 



