4.5,"The movie is a great treat for those into Gangster movies or saw the movie this was inspired by, ""Internal Affairs"". It's the generic Cop/Gangster kind of movies' second wind due to the fact that Scorsese uses his creativity to keep us entertained and giving an over done genre a boost. 

Jack Nicholson plays a kingpin of crime like no other!. Matt Damon's acting pulls you into his dilemma.DiCaprio is no longer the pretty boy we are used to and his acting may be a bit too much at parts, but it was just enough for me to buy into his character. The Director had an idea and he knew EXACTLY how he was gonna do it. He got a great cast and used them to their full extent instead of having them stand around and just draw in money.

The story is well woven together and beautifully written with a good amount of humorous parts too. The movie definitely wastes no time, it pulls you right into the story. Delivering a message that ""Nobody is who you think they are"". The story has a lot of thick tension and challenges our morals.

Overall, This movie is a well done movie and got well deserved praise. Great acting and story, is one of many great things and an ending that ends the movie with an ironically humorous ending that I loved. The ending was like the cherry on top of a great sunday! This movie gets my undying praise! Watch this if you haven't already!","6dad0487-f134-4d6c-bc2d-6abda56f2628",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2010-06-09","","RT","904359675"
