4.5,"Another piece of film making from the legendary Martin Scorcesse. After being denied the Oscar for his past works, he finally was able to bring home the gold with this story of whose who. Jack, Leo and Mark bring the heat with fine performances from Baldwin and Damon. The film is a commentary of losing ones identity, thanks in part to government and religious entities. The final scene is brilliant, with Marky Mark standing over the recently departed Matt wondering if he is a rat or not. The vague allusions mimick life as we no longer have clear boundries of who is what. Top rated, fantastic film.","9428547d-4419-47f9-8aec-cdd050ba119c",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2010-06-10","","RT","901209579"
