5.0,"How rare is it to find the perfect movie? 
A movie with a great cast? A great director? A great composer?
A great story? Great performances? Great suspense?
It's few and far between, and The Departed is one of them.
It's a remake but Scorsese has captured our attention with a sharp, witty thriller. The script boasts a mighty backbone, coupled with deep, memorable dialogues and performances of a lifetime by Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson and Mark Wahlberg.
The clever cinematography and photography along with Howard Shore's musical trance transforms the powerful words on a paper, through a brilliant filmmaker's head to a masterpiece. It's a film that has to be watched before you die, it's going to be one of the greatest crime thrillers ever made, alongside Scarface, Godfather and Goodfellas.

If you ever wish to see the definition of the word ""climax"" the answer will be after 150 minutes of pure gold, it's certainly one of the best, most unexpected movie finishes we'll ever see.","3021b39d-8e0d-4494-9717-13a303d15571",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-07-22","","RT","901376855"
