4.0,"I kept hearing how Inception was the best Leonardo movie since Departed. so of course I had to see it. Verdict: It's amazing. Though there is way way too much swearing in it. I literally don't think I have ever seen a movie with this much swearing before. It was really distracting. And while some would say that it made it gritty and raw, I doubt that the entire Boston police force is that sophomoric. (God I hope not anyway.)

However aside from that the movie itself is amazing. Don't let anyone fool you. At it's heart this is a spy movie. The mob boss raises a boy who becomes a cop, and the cops plant an undercover spy to join the mob. throughout the entire movie there are so many headgames that both sides are paying with each other to get ahead. and trust me i highly doubt you can predict even half of the plot twists in this movie.","5ac14cad-5008-470c-8118-39adf620722a",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2010-08-02","","RT","884877283"
