5.0,"This really is the perfect movie. A gangster drama not only containing the necessary blood and violence, but also showcasing typical Scorsese humor. Matt Damon and Leonardo DiCaprio shine as leads but the real beauty lies in the roles of the supporting actors. Wahlberg, Sheen, Baldwin, Farmiga, and Nicholson all do fantastic jobs with their respected roles. The direction Scorsese takes is awesome, and the ending has you wondering, what just happened? It is truly a masterpiece from start to finish, and one could argue it's the best gangster movie ever. This is my favorite of the genre, and it's a must see for all!","6f260caf-207d-47d5-935e-c1d708a868d7",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2010-08-14","","RT","904854666"
4.0,"Another masterclass from DiCaprio, if only the rest of the cast could follow suit. A film about identity set in the Irish-American gangland of Boston. DiCaprio and Damon are both men who are undercover working for the police and the mob respectively. This is a cat and mouse story with plenty of twists to keep you guessing. Perfect Scorcese territory then but you feel that it was too easy, too familiar for him and that if only he'd step outside his comfort zone he could make his next masterpiece. Not up there with Goodfellas or Taxi Driver but a very enjoyable thriller.","d95dc590-def3-4559-adff-6abfcb7a2b70",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2010-08-14","","RT","819834243"
