4.0,"Martin Scorsese is such a brilliant director, The Aviator is one of my favourite films and so is Goodfellas. However the reason I didn't give this 100 percent was because of the unexpected plot twist and the end which ruined the whole film, why do the two main characters die so unexpectedly in the last 10 minuites, shutter island was the same- check out my review and you will know what I mean.

Critisizing over. The Departed is an enriching crime drama as brilliant as Heat or Goodfellas. Jack Nicholson should have recieved an oscar nomination for best supporting actor because he is funny, scary crazy and thrilling as the leader of a Mob Gang. Damon and Dicaprio throw themselves into the roles and uncover moles for the Police and the Gangs respectively. There are some brilliant scenes in the Departed such as the scene where the raid takes place.

