3.0,"...Woah this movie was long! 2hrs and half! Having watched this only once, i'm guessing it's a grower and that's why it's popular. My friend said she didn't like it in her first watch and now it's her favourite film, so maybe i'll give it a re watch in a while. For now though, it's just ok-good.

The first 45 minutes were introducing the characters, we didn't need that long! Yes, the characters are complex and have a few layers, but get on with the story already!

Great performances from DiCaprio and Damon and some major badass action scenes. Those two characters clashed brilliantly towards the end of the film. A lot of talking and conferences though, which were dull and let it down. The pacing was a bit off and the film seemed pretty slow but at least the plot made sense and it was entertaining, leading to a good climax. Said climax is epic and the best part of the film, bumping up my rating.

I didn't like Jack Nicolson's character in this, but maybe that's just cause I don't lie those kind of people; arrogant, rude and cold gangsters. 

