4.5,"Based on a Hong Kong crime thriller, the setting is transplanted to gritty South Boston where an undercover cop and a mole for the town's major crime boss play cat-and-mouse with one another. One of Scorsese's best films, and also his most complex. The spy games demand repeat viewings in order to fully understand the intricacies of the characters' relationships towards one another. Coupled with his exhilarating pace and editing, it also demands a great deal of focus, but the superlative performances from the cast make this a doable enough task for the average movie-goer. Scorsese deserved every award he ever got for this film, including his long-overdue Best Director.","0579e7f3-7431-4964-aa39-1980e7cf76fa",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2010-12-20","","RT","782913579"
