5.0,"First off I would like to start off by saying this is my favourite Scorsese movie.  Probably tied for my favourite DiCaprio movie(the other is Inception), and in my top 5 movies of all time.  Forget Goodfellas, forget Casino, forget Donnie Brasco, and forget Scarface.  To me those are some of the most iconic gangster movies of all time, hell some of the most iconic movies of all time.  And in my opinion The Departed is better than all those I listed above.  Although I really really loved Casino, Goodfellas and Donnie Brasco I think The Departed is a step above.

The Departed is about an unwanted cop who has to go undercover into Frank Costellos gang.  Well he is in he has to deal with crooked cops, rats, and of course not getting caught.

I am tired of everyone saying Leonardo DiCaprio cannot be a bad ass character.  I think he definitely can and did in The Departed.  Another actor that did really well was Mark Wahlberg, I loved his character and the way he acted the character was near perfection.  Of course Nicholson as Costello was amazing.  And Matt Damon played his character really well as well.

With a cast like this the movie was bound for greatness, and it well exceeded all my expectations.  DiCaprio impresses me with every performance, and Wahlberg has sown me that he is a very very good actor as well after I have seen many of his movies lately.  

The Departed is an instant classic and one of the best movies ever made in my opinion

My personal rating
100%","a657acd9-7b22-49e9-9eb6-70df87992d8b",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2011-01-08","","RT","906458414"
