4.5,"I heard of this movie when it won the Oscar for Best Picture back in 2007, but never got around to watching it. Once I looked up the full cast, i was sold. So, I went into this movie with high expectations, and I'm glad to say that they were fulfilled. The storyline is vivid and throws you for some loops every here and there. As I mentioned earlier, it was very well cast. I'm not a big Leonardo DiCaprio fan, but I will have to say that this is his best performance. Matt Damon does a good job playing his two-sided role. As always, Jack Nicholson impresses. I still can't express how much I loved the plots that were going on. Once they collide, all the stops are pulled out. In the end, it was the classic tale of cops and mobsters with a Scorsese twist.","a84ba85b-b725-44c8-a3b2-25f0d27ff0c8",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2011-02-08","","RT","901311408"
