5.0,"Infiltrados es una de las mejores pelÃ­culas de Martin Scorsese, al nivel de Taxi Driver, Uno de los nuestros o Casino. Bien dirigida (se sabe mover bien por las calles de una gran ciudad), puede pecar de pretenciosa pero tiene acciÃ³n, suspense, y ademÃ¡s lleva mensaje (la brutalidad de la calle afecta a todos intercambiando a buenos y malos). Bien Dicaprio y Damon, bien tambiÃ (C)n Sheen (Martin) y Wahlberg. Nicholson flaquea un poco y aunque un poco de histrionismo es bueno en su personaje, se pasa. Aunque su metraje es largo, no llega a cansar. MagnÃ­fica pelÃ­cula........ The Departed it is one of the Martin Scorsese's best movies, at the level of Taxi Driver, Goodfellas or Casino. Directed well (it can move well for the streets of a great city), it can sin of pretentious but it has action, suspense, and in addition it takes message (the brutality of the street affects all exchanging to good and bad). Well Dicaprio and Damon, also well Sheen (Martin) and Wahlberg. Nicholson weakens a bit and though a bit of histrionics it belongs good at his personage, passes. Though his footage is long, it does not manage to tire. Magnificent movie.","adf15603-e053-458e-8094-72033e2e5cf2",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2011-03-10","","RT","899158360"
