5.0,"I find this to be an extremely worthy addition to Martin Scorsese's many works. The film tells a rich and complex story about an undercover cop investigating a crime boss while an informant working for the crime boss infiltrates the police department. The cast is overall excellent including the work of Leonardo DiCaprio, Matt Damon, Jack Nicholson, and Mark Wahlberg. I particularly love how we get to see Leonardo's character become fearful during his mission because it adds to the suspense of the film because there is a clear sense that he is in a dangerous situation. I also really enjoyed Mark Wahlberg as the gutter-mouthed police sergeant because he has some of the funniest lines and monologues in the movie and was convincing. The film also features various twists and turns that add to the films complexity and power. Overall, I think this film ranks as one of Scorsese's best films and I am glad he won the Oscar for it.","0988b697-62b9-4ce6-80c9-8b7fb959c833",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2011-03-30","","RT","905737071"
