4.5,"The best part of this movie is the dialogue - while extremely gritty - it is also extremely honest.  Which is probably the reason this movie works so well.  The difference between cop and criminal is an interesting topic of conversation.  Jack Nicholson is great as Francis - aka the devil.  DiCaprio and Damon are excellent and even Alec Baldwin has some good moments.  Scorsese's fingerprints are all over this and this is definetely one of his best movies - maybe since Goodfellas.  And finally the story is good - the cop or not a cop plot is compelling and the ending is a surprise.","9fff641e-94dd-4722-bd7f-f3dd2d675f35",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2011-08-29","","RT","784078298"
