5.0,"Let me just start by saying that I KNEW everyone was going to die by the end of this movie.  Freaking Scorsese.  Irregardless, on with the review.  As I'm sure you've well heard by now, The Departed is a pretty freaking amazing movie, and it does not disappoint.  The nonstop backstabbing will have your head spinning, and by the end of this film, you'll start to wonder if your own parents are really your real parents or parishioners on a mission to convert you.  In my opinion, the real mole here was the female psychologist who played both of our male antagonists GOOD. She had both of them in the palm of her hand.  Anyways, great movie all round, and I strongly recommend adding this one to your collection.  And if you don't have a collection, now is the time to start!","a6599aad-a7d5-46fd-bd53-842e688a1f44",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2011-12-04","","RT","905962036"
