4.5,"Winning four Academy Awards, The Departed is another of Scorsese's crime films, and a damn good one at that! Scorsese directing is exhilarating, William Monahan's screenplay is exceptional and the star-studded cast deliver an outstanding performance from start to finish, especially DiCaprio and Nicholson's. This crime thriller has a brilliant plot and keeps a good pace; tension builds throughout and engrosses your attention. The title card may appear twenty minutes in but the build up to it is spectacular and the execution is perfect, especially with the recurring Dropkick Murphy's song ""I'm Shipping Up To Boston"" which is intense and totally reflects the tone. The Departed is one of the best films of 2006 and one of Scorsese's best to date.","6f0e6030-ee83-407f-b167-a7d13f766b8f",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2012-03-12","","RT","921739401"
