2.0,"The Departed is an odd animal for me.  On one hand, I can recognize it as a quality made movie with excellent performances that deserves most of, if not all of, the praise that is showered upon it.  On the other hand, my personal opinion of this film is something different.  I should note that I've always had trouble getting into organized crime films, especially the long winded ones, and have also had trouble enjoying the films of Martin Scorsese.  So, from the word go, this film has a lot of work to do to win me over, and it fell short.  I figure it was at about the one hour mark that I couldn't take it anymore and started looking for something to entertain myself with.  While I did finish the film, I can't say I was really paying attention to much of the second half.  The only saving grace was the ending, but I had previously had the ending spoiled for me before watching the film, so I didn't even get that enjoyment.  I respect the opinion of everyone who liked this film and I do recognize that it is a quality movie, but it is one that I will never again attempt to watch.","659a591f-9c58-459b-8395-09a6f05146b1",False,False,False,False,2.0,"2012-04-01","","RT","912898303"
