4.0,"This movie makes Street Kings look like child's play. Man, a cop movie has never been this GOOD.
Leonardo DiCaprio is a superb actor, and I don't know why it took me so long to add him to my favourite actors area on my Flixster page. 
The chemistry he has onscreen with Damon and Nicholson helps the movie flow well, without flopping into a typical Hollywood cop movie.
The plot of the movie is for the intellectual type as it's not one of your average, predictable plots.
DiCaprio, Damon, Nicholson and Wahlberg help bring the various themes of the movie to life: Corrupted cops, and the father and son relationship with Costello and Costigan, and Costello and Sullivan.
The ending was kind of pointless though, with everyone getting gunned down but hey, who said Scorsese wasn't going to end the movie with a big bang!
See DiCaprio grow immensely as an actor in this movie, as he steals the show hands down, without a doubt!","12346a70-1186-4fe6-8554-459d253d9ed2",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2012-05-30","","RT","873218102"
