5.0,"""The Departed"" is by far one of the best movies of the past decade. As well as one of the greatest movies ever made. It definately deserved the accademy award for best picture, along with with every other award it got.
It is one of the rare movies that leaves you almost nothing to complain about. The story is an original nonstop thrill ride. The directing, editing, and music are perfect.
And the absolute best thing about it is the acting. And what else would you expect? Your three leads are Leonardo Dicaprio, Matt Damon, and Jack Nicholson. Not to mentoin a amazing cast of supporting actors.
This movie is an absolute must see. It is one of the few movies where everthing hits the right note. And is worth checking out for the acting alone.

