5.0,"Martin Scorsese is a genius, and it shows in this great film. Great acting across the board. It's hard to distinguish anyone as a stand out since almost every actor does a great job. One of the longer movies I own, but it's such a great movie that there is never a moment where you are bored or waiting for the story to pick up. Nobody how many times I watch it, I still find it just as good as the first time I watched it. Definitely one of the best movies I've ever seen.","c62a0b9f-edef-477e-8ac3-40edc26b76bb",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2012-10-20","","RT","921411057"
4.5,"I saw this one by myself because I couldn'tmanage to coax any of my friends into seeing it with me.  So instead of witing for it to come out on dvd like I did Four Brothers (at which point all my friends wanted to see it:P) I took the initiative an went by myself, something I hadn't done since Any Given Sunday, another great flick.  This was a very well put together movie with a great ensemble cast doing an amazing job.  It turns out that the guy who wrote it is the same guy who wrote Kingdom of Heaven, a movie that must be seen in director's cut form if it is to be seen at all in my opinion.

