5.0,"Leonardo DiCaprio and Matt Damon have it out in a film that brings out the Boston mafia and gives you ten times what you bargain for. All of this is rolled up into a nice little blunt that Jack Nicholson is lighting up so you can smoke this movie in and enjoy every last inch of it. How this movie didn't snatch up all the Oscars is beyond me! The Departed is a star-studded piece of perfection, directed by the man who brought mafia movies back to life more than once, Mr. Martin Scorsese. With a script that reads like water flowing down your throat, this film is a guaranteed home run with a beer and some bullets flying as well. However, this film does contain a lot of swearing, which I didn't mind, but some may choose to opt out, on behalf of this. But, if swearing isn't a problem and you enjoy mafia movies to their fullest, I gotta say that you can't go wrong with The Departed. The film is absolute genius and I doubt I'll ever see one like this again.","d5e1ce28-588a-494f-9db3-3a6d71d70e40",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2012-11-12","","RT","873387188"
