4.5,"""Good or Bad,Cop or Criminal,when you're facing a loaded gun,what's the difference?""

I cannot quite believe it.On first AND second viewings I found this movie tedious.Overly profane,overly violent and just dull.Forget that I thought that.

The Departed is 21st century Scorsese,doing what  he does best: gangster movies.As soon as the film opens,comparison to 'Goodfellas'  begins.Let me tell you that this movie is NOTHING like Goodfellas.The plot is more complex and the brutality increased,this is the most hard hitting mafia movie you may ever see.
