5.0,"We know that guns, gangs, realistic hitting and punchy dialogues are a usual traits in a Gangster film and thats what is looked up for in them. 

As an Audience, at the age of 18 I witnessed this movie as a life changing one. And the key reason for it would be everything present in the Film. Its got a tight screenplay, brilliant storyline, epic star cast (Nicholson and DiCaprio..two epic performers) and specialist director in the form of Martin Scorsese. We all know that he should have won an Oscar long back, but Oscars recognized him for this one and you bet they did it right. If they had not done it, then it would have counted as one of the big Bloopers in the history of Oscars. 

I loved Jack Nicholson as ""Frank Costello"". He makes the character look so fierce and funky at the same time, which perhaps no one could do considering the age and the punch that is needed for it. Rest perform to their level best. A true movie which shall be remembered and cherished for years to come.","a060fecb-2849-4e94-afe1-282382151864",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2015-09-04","","RT","906053446"
