4.5,"The 79th Academy Awards winner... an undercover cop and a mole in the police attempt to identify each other while infiltrating an Irish gang in South Boston. I generally do not like crime films, but this one was fine. The plot was excellent and a bit difficult to understand. Once you really understand, you'll like it. Martin Scorsese's direction and Matt Damon and Leonardo DiCaprio made it believable. Winner of 4 Oscars, including Best Picture and Best Adapted Screenplay.","5f255ed8-5e73-46c3-a84b-c658a7bd42b3",False,False,False,False,4.5,"2017-07-07","johann m","RT","9b7adedd-306d-4d53-b8a0-cad2865cc859"
