5.0,"I recently watched Face/Off with Nic Cage and John Travolta. It’s a fun movie, super over the top crazy and memorable. But it’s cheesy. I have realized that not only is the departed a 10/10 movie, but it is an infinitely more polished, real, gritty version of Face/Off. You get all the twists and smart script movements that come with such crazy premises, but in this movie it’s all believable. Yes, there are some coincidences, but life has coincidences. From the enticing beginning to the oddly satisfying and sad final scene, The Departed is a wild ride and one of Scorsese’s best. He picked an incredible ensemble cast, and made the absolute best of them. 10/10","e1b23769-1635-4104-b7a1-df8279fc11c6",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2018-06-17","","Flixster","65b0ccbc-694c-46e6-bae8-108ee3519f57"
