4.0,"The Departed has Scorsese return to his Italian mafia roots and the film is an absolute blast. Featuring a bucket load of talent both in front and behind the camera Departed was a remake of a Hong Kong movie Infernal Affairs.  Set in Boston and involving the FBI and moles this is a film that will make you never trust the good cops again. It makes you realize almost everyone is corrupt to a degree. Mark Whalberg, Leonardo Di Caprio and Matt Damon are in top form and ably guided by legends like Jack Nicholson and Martin Sheen.","2970c6cd-5a5b-41bf-bc49-9db9bf5cffbe",False,False,False,False,4.0,"2018-07-12","","RT","977348522"
