5.0,"One of my favorite movies. Nicholson is at the top of his bad guy game, and gives one his most ruthless and refined performances in years. Leo is great as always. Matt Damon really makes you dislike him by the end of the movie. Wahlberg is hilarious. Baldwin, Sheen, and Vera Farmiga all kill it. Basically, it is a very well acted movie; and the actor’s talents are on full display thanks in large part to the magnificent script, interesting and twisting story, and Scorsese‘s elite direction. SIDENOTE: this could very possibly have been Jack Nicholson‘s last Great character/film, and it is also one of Scorsese’s best. For those two reasons alone it should be seen by everyone who enjoys movies.","3660144a-e9e4-4ecf-821b-3234c63a5b6e",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2018-07-13","","Flixster","fca7f291-a2d5-408f-a649-f64a45f3e4f1"
