5.0,"Intense, violent and imbued with a sense of realism, ‘The Departed' sees Martin Scorsese bring his directing prowess to a modern gangster film filled with well-written characters played by an all-star cast doing top-notch work. What makes the film so incredibly good, however, is the way Scorsese takes a well-written script with a lot of familiar elements and adds a whole load of complexity and depth, expertly juggling the various components to keep you constantly engaged and, ultimately, delivering something that feels fresh with an absolutely killer ending that you won't forget.","4218c19f-991b-48dc-83e5-9c85e6957798",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2021-06-06","Late R","RT","0cb5a026-fda7-470e-8159-30273587007e"
