5.0,"The Departed in with a doubt of the greatest Martin Scorsese and crime film's ever. There is so much to find great here.

Martin Scorsese shows here how perfect he is at filmmaking. The cinematography is exactly what you expect from Scorsese which is nothing less than masterful. Scorsese has each scene shot from the perfect angles with perfect precision to emphasize the emotion and action of every scene. The direction by Scorsese is all just a work of art. The score similarly is great and really is able to help with the transitions between scenes.

Besides that, the story is able to keep the audience's attention from beginning to end thanks to all of it twists and turns each executed perfectly. The dialogue here is very powerful and makes each character and character interactions all super captivating and powerful. Another thing that make these characters and their interactions so great is the performances. Leonardo DiCaprio and Matt Damon both gave some of their best and most award worthy performance. Jack Nicholson at the age 69 was still making us question if he will ever decline. I feel as if Jack Nicholson just will keep on getting better and better with each and every film.

To simply put it, the Departed is a masterpiece and all humans should see it.","61d8a360-07ce-493d-9857-deab360d8b84",False,False,False,False,5.0,"2024-01-10","Jonathan C","RT","9149f370-ec0a-420e-9b1b-2af4dd853f94"
